#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:249
msgid "To enable pricelists in the Point of Sale app:"
msgstr "För att aktivera prislistor i Kassa-appen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:251
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Navigera till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:252
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, activate the :guilabel:`Flexible "
"Pricelists` feature and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Priser`, aktivera funktionen :guilabel:`Flexibla "
"prislistor` och :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:254
msgid ""
"Once the page reloads, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` "
"to :ref:`configure the pricelists <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"När sidan laddats om, klicka på :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Prislistor` för att :ref:`konfigurera prislistorna <sales/"
"products/pricelist-configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:256
msgid ""
"When configured, return to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>` to add "
"all relevant pricelists to the :guilabel:`Available` field, and select the "
"one to be used as the :guilabel:`Default`."
msgstr ""
"När de är konfigurerade, gå tillbaka till :ref:`kassainställningarna <pos/"
"use/settings>` för att lägga till alla relevanta prislistor i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Tillgänglig` och välj den som ska användas "
"som :guilabel:`Standard`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:261
msgid "Assign pricelists"
msgstr "Tilldela prislistor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:263
msgid ""
"To manually assign a pricelist to an order from the :ref:`POS register <pos/"
"use/open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon and the :icon:`fa-th-list` icon, followed by the currently "
"selected pricelist's name. Then, click the new pricelist to apply."
msgstr ""
"För att manuellt tilldela en prislista till en beställning från :ref:`kassan "
"<pos/use/open-register>`, klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`lodrät ellips`) och ikonen :icon:`fa-th-list`, följt av namnet "
"på den för närvarande valda prislistan. Klicka sedan på den nya prislistan "
"för att tillämpa den."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:268
msgid ""
"You can also set a pricelist to be selected automatically for a "
"specific :ref:`customer <pos/use/customers>`. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Customers`, select the "
"relevant customer, and assign a pricelist in the :guilabel:`Pricelist` field "
"of the :guilabel:`Sales` section in the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också ställa in en prislista så att den automatiskt väljs för en "
"specifik :ref:`kund <pos/use/customers>`. För att göra detta, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Beställningar --> Kunder`, välj relevant kund "
"och tilldela en prislista i fältet :guilabel:`Prislista` i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Försäljning` under fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & "
"Inköp`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:274
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:243
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:260
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:275
msgid ":ref:`Pricelists in eCommerce <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Prislistor i Webbshop <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:280
msgid "Cash rounding"
msgstr "Avrundning av kontanter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:282
msgid ""
"Cash rounding is used when the smallest physical currency denomination (the "
"smallest coin) is higher than the minimum unit of account."
msgstr ""
"Öresavrundning används när den minsta fysiska valutaenheten (det minsta "
"myntet) är högre än den minsta redovisningsenheten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:285
msgid ""
"For example, in countries that have phased out one-cent and two-cent coins, "
"businesses must round the total amount of a cash transaction to the nearest "
"five cents. In Odoo, each point of sale can be individually configured to "
"apply these rounding rules to bills and receipts."
msgstr ""
"I länder som har fasat ut ett- och tvåcentsmynt måste företag till exempel "
"avrunda det totala beloppet för en kontanttransaktion till närmaste fem "
"cent. I Odoo kan varje kassa konfigureras individuellt för att tillämpa "
"dessa avrundningsregler på räkningar och inleveranser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:292
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:31
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:56
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:142
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "Gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:293
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Payment` section, enable :guilabel:`Cash Rounding`."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Betalning`, aktivera :guilabel:`Öresavrundning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:294
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Apply only on cash methods` to deactivate rounding "
"for :doc:`card payments <../payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera :guilabel:`Tillämpa endast på kontantmetoder` för att avaktivera "
"avrundning för :doc:`kortbetalningar <../payment_methods>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:296
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Rounding Method` field, select an existing method or "
"click :guilabel:`Create` to define a new one."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Avrundningsmetod`, välj en befintlig metod eller klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa` för att definiera en ny."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:299
msgid "When creating a new rounding method, define the following:"
msgstr "När du skapar en ny avrundningsmetod, definiera följande:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:301
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Precision`: The value of the smallest coinage available "
"(e.g., 0.05)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avrundningsprecision`: Värdet på det minsta tillgängliga myntet "
"(t.ex. 0,05)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:302
msgid ":guilabel:`Rounding Strategy`: Choose how the adjustment is recorded:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Avrundningsstrategi`: Välj hur korrigeringen registreras:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:304
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Modify tax amount`: The rounding difference is applied in the "
"taxes section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Modifiera momsbelopp`: Avrundningsdifferensen tillämpas i "
"skattesektionen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a rounding line`: The rounding difference is added as a "
"separate line on the receipt and the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lägg till en avrundningsrad`: Avrundningsdifferensen läggs till "
"som en separat rad på kvittot och fakturan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:307
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Profit Account` and :guilabel:`Loss Account`: The accounts used "
"to record the rounding discrepancies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vinstkonto` och :guilabel:`Förlustkonto`: De konton som används "
"för att registrera avrundningsavvikelserna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:309
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Method`: The tie-breaking rule used to determine the "
"direction of the rounding (:guilabel:`Up`, :guilabel:`Down`, "
"or :guilabel:`Nearest`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avrundningsmetod`: Regeln som används för att bestämma "
"avrundningens riktning (:guilabel:`Upp`, :guilabel:`Ner` "
"eller :guilabel:`Närmaste`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:313
msgid ""
"Odoo Point of Sale only supports the :guilabel:`Add a rounding line` "
"rounding strategy."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Point of Sale stöder endast avrundningsstrategin :guilabel:`Add a "
"rounding line`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:317
msgid "Example: Rounding a $19.92 total with a **rounding precision** of 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Exempel: Avrundning av en total på $19,92 med en **avrundningsprecision** på "
"0,05."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:319
msgid ""
"The final total changes depending on the **rounding method** selected in the "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Den slutliga totalen ändras beroende på vilken **avrundningsmetod** som "
"valts i konfigurationen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:327
msgid "Rounding method"
msgstr "Avrundningsmetod"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:328
msgid "Resulting total"
msgstr "Resulterande totalt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:329
msgid "Logic"
msgstr "Logik"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:330
msgid ":guilabel:`Up`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Upp`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:331
msgid "$19.95"
msgstr "$19,95"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:332
msgid "Always rounds toward the higher value."
msgstr "Avrundar alltid mot det högre värdet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:333
msgid ":guilabel:`Down`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ner`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:334
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:337
msgid "$19.90"
msgstr "$19,90"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:335
msgid "Always rounds toward the lower value."
msgstr "Avrundar alltid mot det lägre värdet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:336
msgid ":guilabel:`Nearest`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Närmaste`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:338
msgid "Rounds to the nearest 0.05."
msgstr "Avrundar till närmaste 0,05."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:341
msgid ""
"Rounding only applies to the **Total** of the receipt, not to individual "
"product prices."
msgstr ""
"Avrundning gäller endast för kvittots **totala** belopp, inte för enskilda "
"produktpriser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:346
msgid "Flexible taxes (fiscal positions)"
msgstr "Flexibla skatter (skattepositioner)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:348
msgid ""
"When running a business, you may need to apply different taxes and record "
"transactions on various accounts based on the location and type of business "
"of your customers and providers."
msgstr ""
"När du driver ett företag kan du behöva tillämpa olika skatter och "
"registrera transaktioner på olika konton beroende på var dina kunder och "
"leverantörer finns och vilken typ av verksamhet de bedriver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:351
msgid ""
"Fiscal positions allow you to define rules that automatically select the "
"appropriate taxes and accounts used for each transaction."
msgstr ""
"Skatteområden gör det möjligt att definiera regler som automatiskt väljer "
"lämpliga skatter och konton för varje transaktion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:355
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finans/redovisning/skatter/fiskala_positioner`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:356
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finans/redovisning/skatter`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:361
msgid ""
"To use fiscal positions, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section, and enable :guilabel:`Flexible Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"För att använda skatteområden, gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> "
"Konfiguration --> Inställningar`, skrolla ner till "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Bokföring` och aktivera :guilabel:`Flexibla skatter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:364
msgid "Then, configure the fiscal position for your POS:"
msgstr "Konfigurera sedan skatteområdet för ditt kassasystem:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:366
msgid ""
"Set the default fiscal position to be automatically applied to all sales in "
"the selected POS using the :guilabel:`Default` field."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in standardskatteområdet som automatiskt ska tillämpas på all "
"försäljning i det valda kassasystemet med hjälp av "
"fältet :guilabel:`Standard`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:368
msgid ""
"Select additional fiscal positions in the :guilabel:`Allowed` field to make "
"them selectable during sales."
msgstr ""
"Välj ytterligare skatteområden i fältet :guilabel:`Tillåtna` för att göra "
"dem valbara under försäljning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:371
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed :doc:`fiscal localization package </applications/"
"finance/fiscal_localizations>`, several fiscal positions are already "
"preconfigured and ready to use in the POS. You can also :ref:`create new "
"ones <fiscal_positions/configuration>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på det installerade :doc:`skattelokaliseringspaketet </applications/"
"finance/fiscal_localizations>` är flera skatteområden redan förkonfigurerade "
"och redo att användas i kassasystemet. Du kan också :ref:`skapa nya "
"<fiscal_positions/configuration>` om det behövs."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:377
msgid ""
":ref:`A default fiscal position can also be assigned to a customer "
"<accounting/fiscal_positions/partner>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ett standardskatteområde kan också tilldelas en kund <accounting/"
"fiscal_positions/partner>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:379
msgid ""
"If no fiscal position is configured, the tax defined in the "
"product's :guilabel:`Sales Taxes` field is applied."
msgstr ""
"Om inget skatteområde är konfigurerat tillämpas skatten som definierats i "
"produktens fält :guilabel:`Försäljningsskatter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:383
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`presets <presets>` to define specific fiscal positions based on "
"whether customers dine in, take their order to go, or have it delivered."
msgstr ""
"Använd :doc:`förinställningar <presets>` för att definiera specifika "
"skatteområden baserat på om kunden äter på plats, tar med sig beställningen "
"eller får den levererad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:387
msgid "Apply fiscal positions"
msgstr "Tillämpa skatteområden"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:389
msgid ""
"To apply a fiscal position to a POS order in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, click the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Tax` button, and "
"choose the desired fiscal position from the list."
msgstr ""
"För att tillämpa ett skatteområde på en kassasystemsbeställning "
"i :ref:`kassaregistret <pos/use/open-register>`, klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertikal ellips`), klicka på knappen :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Skatt` och välj önskat skatteområde från listan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:5
msgid ""
"The self-ordering mode allows customers to browse the menu or product "
"catalog, place an order, and complete payment using their mobile device or a "
"self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Självbeställningsläget gör det möjligt för kunder att bläddra i menyn eller "
"produktkatalogen, lägga en beställning och slutföra betalningen med sin "
"mobila enhet eller en självbeställningskiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:13
msgid ""
"To enable the self-ordering mode, access the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
"settings>`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Mobile self-order & Kiosk` "
"section, and, in the :guilabel:`QR menu & Kiosk activation` section, select "
"a :guilabel:`Self Ordering` type from the dropdown list."
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera självbeställningsläget går du till :ref:`kassasystemets "
"inställningar <pos/use/settings>`, skrollar ner till sektionen "
":guilabel:`Mobil självbeställning & kiosk` och väljer i sektionen "
":guilabel:`QR-meny & kioskaktivering` en :guilabel:`Självbeställning`-typ "
"från rullgardinsmenyn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can choose between :guilabel:`QR menu`, :guilabel:`QR menu + Ordering`, "
"and :guilabel:`Kiosk`."
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja mellan :guilabel:`QR-meny`, :guilabel:`QR-meny + Beställning` "
"och :guilabel:`Kiosk`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:99
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:207
msgid "QR menu"
msgstr "QR-meny"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`QR menu` or :guilabel:`QR menu + Ordering` to give "
"customers access to the menu or product catalog by scanning a QR code on "
"their personal device. The latter also allows them to place an order and "
"make a payment. Then:"
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`QR-meny` eller :guilabel:`QR-meny + Beställning` för att ge "
"kunder tillgång till menyn eller produktkatalogen genom att skanna en QR-kod "
"på sin personliga enhet. Det senare alternativet tillåter dem även att lägga "
"en beställning och göra en betalning. Därefter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Print QR Codes` to download a .pdf "
"document with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Skriv ut QR-koder` för att ladda "
"ner ett .pdf-dokument med de genererade QR-koderna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:30
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Download QR Codes` to download a "
"compressed file with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Ladda ner QR-koder` för att "
"ladda ner en komprimerad fil med de genererade QR-koderna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Free Metal / Wood Stands` to `order "
"QR code stands from Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-restaurant-"
"qr-code>`_."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Gratis metall-/träställ` för att "
"`beställa QR-kodställ från Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-"
"restaurant-qr-code>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:36
msgid ""
"In :ref:`restaurants <pos/restaurant/floors>`, printing or downloading QR "
"codes generates as many QR codes as the number of available tables. In "
"**shops**, it generates only one generic QR code."
msgstr ""
"I :ref:`restauranger <pos/restaurant/floors>` genererar utskrift eller "
"nedladdning av QR-koder lika många QR-koder som antalet tillgängliga bord. I "
"**butiker** genereras endast en generisk QR-kod."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"To customize QR codes, scan the relevant QR code to acquire its URL, then "
"use a QR code generator (e.g., `QR code monkey <https://www.qrcode-"
"monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-generator.com>`_, or "
"`JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_) to create a "
"custom QR code."
msgstr ""
"För att anpassa QR-koder skannar du relevant QR-kod för att hämta dess URL, "
"och använder sedan en QR-kodgenerator (t.ex. `QR code monkey <https://"
"www.qrcode-monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-"
"generator.com>`_ eller `JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://"
"justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_) för att skapa en anpassad QR-kod."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Kiosk` to let customers browse the menu or product "
"catalog, place orders, and pay directly at a self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Kiosk` för att låta kunder bläddra i menyn eller "
"produktkatalogen, lägga beställningar och betala direkt i en "
"självbeställningskiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:50
msgid ""
"Once a self-ordering type is selected, click :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Preview Web interface` under the :guilabel:`Self Ordering` "
"field to ensure all :ref:`additional settings <pos/self_order/additional-"
"settings>` are correctly applied."
msgstr ""
"När en självbeställningstyp har valts klickar du på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Förhandsvisa webbgränssnitt` under fältet "
":guilabel:`Självbeställning` för att säkerställa att alla :ref:`ytterligare "
"inställningar <pos/self_order/additional-settings>` tillämpas korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:57
msgid "Additional settings"
msgstr "Ytterligare inställningar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:59
msgid ""
"To further configure the self-ordering options, use the settings in "
"the :guilabel:`Mobile self-order & Kiosk` section."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera alternativen för självbeställning ytterligare använder "
"du inställningarna i sektionen :guilabel:`Mobil självbeställning och kiosk`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:64
msgid "Home buttons"
msgstr "Hemknappar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:66
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Home buttons` are displayed on the kiosk or mobile device "
"interfaces when customers are self-ordering. To set them up, click :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`Home buttons`. Then,"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Hemknapparna` visas på kiosk- eller mobilenhetsgränssnitten när "
"kunder gör egenskapade beställningar. För att konfigurera dem, klicka "
"på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Hemknappar`. Därefter,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:70
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to add a new button."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Ny` för att lägga till en ny knapp."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:71
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Label`."
msgstr "Ange :guilabel:`Etikett`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:72
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`URL` preceded by `https://` to redirect customers to a "
"specific URL when clicking the button. For instance, you might want to "
"redirect them to a campaign video for a new product or to a contest page."
msgstr ""
"Ange en :guilabel:`URL` som föregås av `https://` för att omdirigera kunder "
"till en specifik URL när de klickar på knappen. Du kanske till exempel vill "
"omdirigera dem till en kampanjvideo för en ny produkt eller till en "
"tävlingssida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the same :guilabel:`URL` column, enter `/products` to create a button "
"that redirects customers to the product catalog."
msgstr ""
"I samma :guilabel:`URL`-kolumn, ange `/products` för att skapa en knapp som "
"omdirigerar kunder till produktkatalogen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:77
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Points of Sale` to ensure this button only appears on "
"the selected POS's self-ordering interface."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Kassasystem` för att säkerställa att denna knapp endast "
"visas på det valda kassasystemets egenskapade beställningsgränssnitt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:79
msgid "Select a predefined :guilabel:`Style` from the dropdown menu."
msgstr "Välj en fördefinierad :guilabel:`Stil` från rullgardinsmenyn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:82
msgid ""
"Leaving the :guilabel:`Points of Sale` field empty shares the button with "
"all POS."
msgstr ""
"Om :guilabel:`Kassasystem`-fältet lämnas tomt delas knappen med alla "
"kassasystem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:83
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preview` column automatically updates to show the button's "
"appearance for the selected :guilabel:`Style`."
msgstr ""
"Kolumnen :guilabel:`Förhandsvisning` uppdateras automatiskt för att visa "
"knappens utseende för vald :guilabel:`Stil`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:86
msgid "Service location and payment options"
msgstr "Serviceplats och betalningsalternativ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:88
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Service at` field, specify where the service takes place "
"by selecting :guilabel:`Table` or :guilabel:`Pickup zone`. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Pay after` field, define when customers pay. Depending on the "
"self-ordering type, service location, and POS type, customers can pay after "
"their :guilabel:`Meal` or after :guilabel:`Each order` and choose from "
"different payment options."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Servering vid` anger du var serveringen sker genom att "
"välja :guilabel:`Bord` eller :guilabel:`Avhämtningszon`. Ange därefter i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Betala efter` när kunderna betalar. Beroende på typ av "
"självbeställning, serveringsplats och typ av kassasystem kan kunderna betala "
"efter sin :guilabel:`Måltid` eller efter :guilabel:`Varje beställning` och "
"välja mellan olika betalningsalternativ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:95
msgid ""
"Service zones can also be defined for :doc:`presets <presets>` used for self-"
"ordering."
msgstr ""
"Servicezoner kan också definieras för :doc:`förinställningar <presets>` som "
"används för egenskapade beställningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Restaurants**: Customers can be served at their :guilabel:`Table` or at "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup zone`."
msgstr ""
"**Restauranger**: Kunder kan serveras vid sitt :guilabel:`Bord` eller vid "
":guilabel:`Avhämtningszon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:104
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Table` service, they can pay after their :guilabel:`Meal` or "
"after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"För service vid :guilabel:`Bord` kan de betala efter sin :guilabel:`Måltid` "
"eller efter :guilabel:`Varje beställning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:106
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Pickup zone` service, they can only pay after :guilabel:`Each "
"order`."
msgstr ""
"För service vid :guilabel:`Avhämtningszon` kan de endast betala efter "
":guilabel:`Varje beställning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Shops**: Customers can only be served at the :guilabel:`Pickup zone` and "
"pay after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"**Butiker**: Kunder kan endast betjänas vid :guilabel:`Avhämtningszon` och "
"betala efter :guilabel:`Varje beställning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:110
msgid ""
"Customers can pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>` or "
"using any configured :doc:`payment method <../payment_methods>`. If "
"the :guilabel:`Online Payment` field is left empty, customers pay at the "
"cashier."
msgstr ""
"Kunder kan betala :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>` "
"eller med valfri konfigurerad :doc:`betalningsmetod <../payment_methods>`. "
"Om fältet :guilabel:`Betalning online` lämnas tomt betalar kunderna i kassan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:116
msgid ""
"Customers can be served at their :guilabel:`Table` or at "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup zone`, but they must pay after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"Kunder kan serveras vid sitt :guilabel:`Bord` eller vid "
":guilabel:`Avhämtningszon`, men de måste betala efter :guilabel:`Varje "
"beställning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:118
msgid ""
"Payment via a terminal is only possible with :doc:`Adyen <../payment_methods/"
"terminals/adyen>`, :doc:`Stripe <../payment_methods/terminals/stripe>`, "
"or :doc:`Viva.com <../payment_methods/terminals/viva_com>` terminals."
msgstr ""
"Betalning via terminal är endast möjlig med terminaler från :doc:`Adyen <../"
"payment_methods/terminals/adyen>`, :doc:`Stripe <../payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>` eller :doc:`Viva.com <../payment_methods/terminals/"
"viva_com>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:122
msgid ""
"To pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>`, customers "
"must scan the displayed QR code."
msgstr ""
"För att betala :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>` måste "
"kunderna skanna den visade QR-koden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Cash` payments are not supported."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kontant`-betalningar stöds inte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:127
msgid ""
"Regardless of the self-ordering configuration, only one :guilabel:`Online "
"Payment` method can be added."
msgstr ""
"Oavsett konfigurationen för självbeställning kan endast en metod för "
":guilabel:`Betalning online` läggas till."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:131
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Payment Methods` to :doc:`create or "
"edit payment methods <../payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Betalningsmetoder` för att "
":doc:`skapa eller redigera betalningsmetoder <../payment_methods>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:135
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:136
msgid ":doc:`../payment_methods`"
msgstr ":doc:`../payment_methods`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:138
msgid "Launch on IoT Box"
msgstr "Starta på IoT-box"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:140
msgid ""
"This option allows for using an :doc:`IoT Box </applications/general/iot/"
"iot_box>` connected to a touchscreen as a self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ möjliggör användning av en :doc:`IoT-box </applications/"
"general/iot/iot_box>` ansluten till en pekskärm som en "
"självbeställningskiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:143
msgid ""
":doc:`Connect an IoT Box </applications/general/iot/connect>` to your Odoo "
"database."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Anslut en IoT-box </applications/general/iot/connect>` till din Odoo-"
"databas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:144
msgid ""
"Ensure a touchscreen :doc:`display </applications/general/iot/devices/"
"screen>` is connected."
msgstr ""
"Se till att en beröringskänslig :doc:`skärm </applications/general/iot/"
"devices/screen>` är ansluten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:146
msgid "Select the IoT Box from the :guilabel:`Launch on` field."
msgstr "Välj IoT-boxen från fältet :guilabel:`Launch on`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once connected to the IoT box, the touchscreen display appears as two "
"separate devices in the IoT box's list of devices: a display and a keyboard "
"input device."
msgstr ""
"När den är ansluten till IoT-boxen visas pekskärmen som två separata enheter "
"i IoT-boxens enhetslista: en skärm och en tangentbordsinmatningsenhet."

