#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:8
msgid ""
"Since the `Chromium 142 update <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142>`_, using a self-signed certificate is no longer required. The "
"recommended approach is to use the :doc:`Local Network Access <pos_lna>` "
"method instead."
msgstr ""
"Sedan `Chromium 142-uppgraderingen <https://developer.chrome.com/release-"
"notes/142>`_ krävs inte längre användning av ett egensignerat certifikat. "
"Det rekommenderade tillvägagångssättet är att använda metoden :doc:`lokal "
"nätverksåtkomst <pos_lna>` istället."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:12
msgid ""
"To work with Odoo, some printer models that can be used without an :doc:`IoT "
"system </applications/general/iot>` may require the HTTPS protocol to "
"establish a secure connection between the browser and the printer. However, "
"trying to reach the printer's IP address using HTTPS results in a warning "
"page in most web browsers. Force the connection to establish an HTTPS link "
"and enable the printer in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"För att fungera med Odoo kan vissa skrivarmodeller som kan användas utan "
"ett :doc:`IoT-system </applications/general/iot>` kräva HTTPS-protokollet "
"för att upprätta en säker anslutning mellan webbläsaren och skrivaren. Att "
"försöka nå skrivarens IP-adress med HTTPS resulterar dock i en varningssida "
"i de flesta webbläsare. Tvinga anslutningen att upprätta en HTTPS-länk och "
"aktivera skrivaren i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:21
msgid "Generation, export, and import of self-signed certificates"
msgstr "Skapa, exportera och importera egenskapade certifikat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:23
msgid ""
"Printers that operate without an :doc:`IoT system </applications/general/"
"iot>` still require secure communication, which can be achieved "
"by :ref:`generating <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-generation>`, :ref:`exporting "
"<pos/epos-ssc/certificate-export>`, and/or :ref:`importing <pos/epos-ssc/"
"certificate-import>` a self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"Skrivare som fungerar utan ett :doc:`IoT-system </applications/general/iot>` "
"kräver fortfarande säker kommunikation, vilket kan uppnås genom "
"att :ref:`skapa <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-generation>`, :ref:`exportera <pos/"
"epos-ssc/certificate-export>` och/eller :ref:`importera <pos/epos-ssc/"
"certificate-import>` ett egenskapat certifikat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:29
msgid ""
"Generating a self-signed certificate should only be done **once**. Creating "
"another certificate causes devices using the previous one to lose HTTPS "
"access."
msgstr ""
"Att skapa ett egenskapat certifikat ska endast göras **en gång**. Att skapa "
"ytterligare ett certifikat gör att enheter som använder det föregående "
"förlorar HTTPS-åtkomst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:31
msgid ""
"Printers that use an :doc:`IoT system </applications/general/iot>` do not "
"need a self-signed certificate, as the IoT box generates it automatically."
msgstr ""
"Skrivare som använder ett :doc:`IoT-system </applications/general/iot>` "
"behöver inte ett egenskapat certifikat, eftersom IoT-boxen skapar det "
"automatiskt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:33
msgid ""
"For stable results, it is strongly recommended to use the Google Chrome "
"browser to generate the self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"För stabila resultat rekommenderas det starkt att använda webbläsaren Google "
"Chrome för att skapa det egenskapade certifikatet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:37
msgid ""
"To export self-signed certificates from an operating system or a web browser "
"that is not mentioned in this documentation, search for `export SSL "
"certificate` and the name of your browser or operating system in the "
"preferred search engine. Similarly, to import self-signed certificates, "
"search for `import SSL certificate root authority` in the preferred search "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"För att exportera egenskapade certifikat från ett operativsystem eller en "
"webbläsare som inte nämns i denna dokumentation, sök efter `export SSL "
"certificate` och namnet på din webbläsare eller ditt operativsystem i den "
"föredragna sökmotorn. På samma sätt, för att importera egenskapade "
"certifikat, sök efter `import SSL certificate root authority` i den "
"föredragna sökmotorn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:45
msgid "Self-signed certificate generation"
msgstr "Skapa egenskapat certifikat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:47
msgid ""
"The generation process depends on the :abbr:`OS (Operating System)` and the "
