msgstr "Importera egenskapade certifikat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:78
msgid ""
"For a long-term solution, the generated certificates must be imported into "
"the device running the POS. The import process is heavily dependent on "
"the :abbr:`OS (Operating System)` and the browser."
msgstr ""
"För en långsiktig lösning måste de genererade certifikaten importeras till "
"enheten som kör kassasystemet. Importprocessen är starkt beroende "
"av :abbr:`OS (Operativsystem)` och webbläsaren."

