msgid ""
"Set up the QFPay terminal by connecting the HaoJin App to the QFPay account "
"as instructed by QFPay, then copy the terminal's IP address."
msgstr ""
"Installera QFPay-terminalen genom att ansluta HaoJin-appen till QFPay-kontot "
"enligt instruktioner från QFPay, kopiera sedan terminalens IP-adress."

