#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:94
msgid ""
"Set the base rental price by entering the lowest rental price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field. Next, click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, "
"then configure the following *Rental* section fields where applicable:"
msgstr ""
"Ange bashyrespriset genom att skriva in det lägsta hyrespriset i fältet "
