"Navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products`, then "
"click the desired product. Click the *Prices* tab and click :guilabel:`Add a "
"price`."
msgstr ""
"Navigera till :menuselection:`Uthyrning --> Produkter --> Produkter` och "
"klicka på önskad produkt. Klicka på fliken *Priser* och därefter på "
":guilabel:`Lägg till ett pris`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:197
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:215
msgid ""
"Select the desired :guilabel:`Pricelist`, then enter the minimum time "
"required for the price change to trigger in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"column. The :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` column is based on the *Periodicity* "
"field in the :guilabel:`Sales` tab."
msgstr ""
"Välj önskad :guilabel:`Prislista` och ange sedan den minsta tid som krävs "
"för att prisändringen ska aktiveras i kolumnen :guilabel:`Min. kvantitet`. "
"Kolumnen :guilabel:`Min. kvantitet` baseras på fältet *Periodicitet* på "
"fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:201
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:219
msgid ""
"Lastly, enter the :guilabel:`Price` rate. Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon near the top to save."
msgstr ""
