#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:5
msgid ""
"Requiring fixed deposits is common in many rental scenarios, such as "
"collecting security deposits. Security deposits are insurance in case of "
"damage, theft, or unpaid fees. It is typically refunded when the rented "
"product is returned in good condition, and all terms of the rental or "
"service agreement are met."
msgstr ""
"Att kräva fasta depositioner är vanligt i många uthyrningssituationer, såsom "
"att ta ut en säkerhetsdeposition. Säkerhetsdepositioner fungerar som en "
"försäkring vid skada, stöld eller obetalda avgifter. Den återbetalas "
"vanligtvis när den hyrda produkten återlämnas i gott skick och alla villkor "
"i hyres- eller tjänsteavtalet är uppfyllda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:10
msgid ""
"This document covers the standard options for :ref:`configuring <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`collecting <rental/"
"rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-product>`, and :ref:`refunding "
"<rental/rental_order/manage_deposits/refund>` deposits within the "
"**Rentals** app."
msgstr ""
"Detta dokument beskriver standardalternativen för att :ref:`konfigurera "
"<rental/rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`ta ut <rental/"
"rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-product>` och :ref:`återbetala "
"<rental/rental_order/manage_deposits/refund>` depositioner i appen "
"**Uthyrning**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:18
msgid ""
"The following apps are essential for configuring deposit service products "
"and processing deposit refunds:"
msgstr ""
"Följande appar är nödvändiga för att konfigurera tjänsteprodukter för "
"depositioner och hantera depositionsåterbetalningar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Sales**: Enables the *Price* tab on product forms when :doc:`../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices` is enabled. Also enables the use of quotation "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"**Försäljning**: Aktiverar fliken *Pris* på produktformulär när :doc:`../../"
"sales/products_prices/prices` är aktiverat. Möjliggör även användning av "
"offertmallar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Accounting**: Enables the use of :doc:`Credit Notes <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` on rental orders, which are "
"required when returning a deposit."
msgstr ""
"**Bokföring**: Aktiverar användningen av :doc:`Kreditnotor <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` på hyresordrar, vilket krävs vid "
"återbetalning av en deposition."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:32
msgid ""
"For every rental product that requires a deposit, a second product **must** "
"be configured specifically for the deposit."
msgstr ""
"För varje hyresprodukt som kräver en deposition **måste** en andra produkt "
"konfigureras specifikt för depositionen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:36
msgid ""
"When configuring a digital camera rental that requires a deposit, two "
"products must be configured: `Digital Camera Rental` and `Digital Camera "
"Rental Deposit` products."
msgstr ""
"När du konfigurerar uthyrning av en digitalkamera som kräver en deposition "
"måste två produkter konfigureras: produkterna `Digital Camera Rental` och "
"`Digital Camera Rental Deposit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:40
msgid ""
"Including the product name within the deposit service product name improves "
"organizational clarity and simplifies deposit tracking."
msgstr ""
"Att inkludera produktnamnet i tjänsteproduktens namn för depositionen "
"förbättrar den organisatoriska överblicken och förenklar spårningen av "
"depositioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Rental --> Products --> Products`, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and clearly name the service product as a deposit."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Uthyrning --> Produkter --> Produkter`, klicka på "
":guilabel:`Ny` och ge tjänsteprodukten ett tydligt namn som deposition."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:46
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Service`, "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Based on Delivered Quantity "
"(Manual)`, and :guilabel:`Sales Price` to the desired deposit amount, and "
"the unit of measure to :guilabel:`Units`."
msgstr ""
"Ställ därefter in :guilabel:`Produkttyp` på :guilabel:`Tjänst`, "
":guilabel:`Faktureringspolicy` på :guilabel:`Baserat på levererad kvantitet "
"(manuell)`, :guilabel:`Försäljningspris` på önskat depositionsbelopp och "
"måttenheten på :guilabel:`Enheter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:50
msgid ""
"Choose whether to include :ref:`Sales Taxes <taxes/product>` for the deposit "
"service product. Finally, :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(save)` the "
"deposit service product."
msgstr ""
"Välj om :ref:`Försäljningsskatter <taxes/product>` ska inkluderas för "
"depositionstjänsteprodukten. :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(spara)` "
"slutligen depositionstjänsteprodukten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:53
msgid ""
"Rental product form configured as a digital camera deposit service in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Uthyrningsproduktformulär konfigurerat som depositionstjänst för en "
"digitalkamera i appen Uthyrning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:59
msgid "Add a deposit to a rental order"
msgstr "Lägg till en deposition på en uthyrningsorder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:61
msgid ""
"There are several methods to add a deposit service product to a rental "
"order, alongside the related product:"
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera metoder för att lägga till en depositionstjänsteprodukt på "
"en uthyrningsorder, tillsammans med den relaterade produkten:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Optional product menu <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-"
"product>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Menyn Tillvalsprodukter <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-"
