#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page describes the *Rental Orders* dashboard, the landing page of the "
"**Rental** app, covering its available views and the status, invoice, and "
"search bar filters used to organize rental orders."
msgstr ""
"Denna sida beskriver dashboarden *Uthyrningsorder*, landningssidan för appen "
"**Uthyrning**, och går igenom dess tillgängliga vyer samt de filter för "
"status, faktura och sökfält som används för att organisera uthyrningsorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:8
msgid "Rental Orders dashboard"
msgstr "Dashboard med uthyrningsordrar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:10
msgid ""
"The *Rental Orders* dashboard serves as the landing page for the **Rental** "
"app. It provides a high-level view of all rental orders, with smart buttons "
"to navigate to filtered lists of rentals. This "
"includes :guilabel:`Pickups`, :guilabel:`Returns`, :guilabel:`Late` returns, "
"rentals :guilabel:`To Confirm`, :guilabel:`To Invoice`, and any action items "
"for :guilabel:`Today`."
msgstr ""
"Översikten *Uthyrningsordrar* fungerar som startsida för appen "
"**Uthyrning**. Den ger en övergripande översikt över alla uthyrningsordrar, "
"med smartknappar för att navigera till filtrerade listor över uthyrningar. "
"Detta inkluderar :guilabel:`Upphämtningar`, :guilabel:`Återlämningar`, "
":guilabel:`Försenade` återlämningar, uthyrningar :guilabel:`Att bekräfta`, "
":guilabel:`Att fakturera` och eventuella åtgärder för :guilabel:`Idag`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:15
msgid ""
"To view the *Rental Orders* dashboard, open the **Rental** app or go "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders`, and the dashboard "
"loads in the default :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(List)` view. Other "
"available views are: :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`(Kanban)`, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`(Calendar)`, :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)`, :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)`, "
"and :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activity)`."
msgstr ""
"För att visa översikten *Uthyrningsordrar* öppnar du appen **Uthyrning** "
"eller går till :menuselection:`Uthyrning --> Ordrar --> Ordrar`, så läses "
"översikten in i standardvyn :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Lista)`. Andra "
"tillgängliga vyer är: :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`(Kanban)`, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`(Kalender)`, :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)`, "
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Diagram)` och :icon:`fa-clock-o` "
":guilabel:`(Aktivitet)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:21
msgid "Example of the Rental Orders Dashboard in the Rental app."
msgstr "Exempel på översikten Uthyrningsordrar i appen Uthyrning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:24
msgid "At the top of the dashboard, there are six smart buttons:"
msgstr "Högst upp i översikten finns det sex smartknappar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Today`: Filters the dashboard to show rental orders "
"whose :guilabel:`Pick up Date` or :guilabel:`Return Date` is the present "
"date. These are rental orders with the status of :guilabel:`Reserved` "
"or :guilabel:`Pickedup`. It also includes orders with late pickup or return "
"dates. This filter is the default filter for the *Rental Orders* dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Idag`: Filtrerar översikten så att den visar uthyrningsordrar "
"vars :guilabel:`Upphämtningsdatum` eller :guilabel:`Återlämningsdatum` är "
"dagens datum. Detta är uthyrningsordrar med statusen :guilabel:`Reserverad` "
"eller :guilabel:`Upphämtad`. Det inkluderar även ordrar med försenade "
"upphämtnings- eller återlämningsdatum. Detta filter är standardfiltret för "
"översikten *Uthyrningsordrar*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pickups`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders with "
"the :guilabel:`Reserved` status that are waiting to be picked up by the "
"customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Upphämtningar`: Filtrerar översikten så att endast "
"uthyrningsordrar med statusen :guilabel:`Reserverad` som väntar på att "
"hämtas av kunden visas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Returns`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders with "
"the :guilabel:`Pickedup` status that have not been returned yet. This "
"includes both on-time and past-due returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Återlämningar`: Filtrerar översikten så att endast "
"uthyrningsordrar med statusen :guilabel:`Upphämtad` som ännu inte har "
"återlämnats visas. Detta inkluderar både returer i tid och försenade returer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Late`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders "
"whose :guilabel:`Pick up Date` or :guilabel:`Return Date` is overdue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Försenade`: Filtrerar instrumentpanelen så att endast hyresordrar "
"vars :guilabel:`Upphämtningsdatum` eller :guilabel:`Returdatum` har "
"passerats visas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Confirm`: Filters the dashboard to show only unconfirmed "
"rental quotations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Att bekräfta`: Filtrerar instrumentpanelen så att endast "
"obekräftade hyresofferter visas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Invoice`: Filters the dashboard to show all rental orders "
"without an invoice created. This includes both :guilabel:`Reserved` "
"and :guilabel:`Pickedup` rentals."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Att fakturera`: Filtrerar instrumentpanelen så att alla "
"hyresordrar utan skapad faktura visas. Detta inkluderar både "
":guilabel:`Reserverade` och :guilabel:`Upphämtade` uthyrningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:41
msgid ""
"Every smart button displays the number of rental orders or quotations within "
"its category. Click the smart button to apply the filter to the search bar. "
"Click it again to remove the filter. Multiple smart buttons can be applied "
"at the same time, further filtering the results."
msgstr ""
