"Merchant)`) with status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` or :guilabel:`PROCESSED`, "
"including:"
msgstr ""
"Synkronisera (Lazada till Odoo) alla bekräftade beställningar (:abbr:`FBM "
"(Fulfilled By Merchant)`) med status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` "
"eller :guilabel:`PROCESSED`, inklusive:"

