#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:22
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to Lazada) all available product quantities (:abbr:`FBM "
"(Fulfilled By Merchant)`)."
msgstr ""
"Synkronisera (Odoo till Lazada) alla tillgängliga produktkvantiteter "
"(:abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:25
msgid ""
"Synchronize the Lazada product catalog into Odoo or map existing Odoo "
"products to Lazada SKUs."
msgstr ""
"Synkronisera Lazadas produktkatalog till Odoo eller mappa befintliga Odoo-"
"produkter till Lazada SKU:er."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:27
msgid ""
"The following table lists capabilities provided by Odoo when using the "
