#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:3
msgid "Lazada order management"
msgstr "Lazada-orderhantering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to manage Lazada orders, inventory, deliveries, and "
"sales reporting within Odoo using the **Lazada Connector**. It covers "
"product catalog mapping, order synchronization, delivery processes, and "
"sales analysis to streamline your marketplace operations in Southeast Asia."
msgstr ""
"Den här guiden förklarar hur du hanterar Lazada-ordrar, lager, leveranser "
"och försäljningsrapportering i Odoo med **Lazada Anslutning**. Den täcker "
"produktkatalogmappning, ordersynkronisering, leveransprocesser och "
"försäljningsanalys för att effektivisera dina marknadsplatsoperationer i "
"Sydostasien."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:6
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:11
msgid "Product catalog mapping"
msgstr "Mappning av produktkatalog"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:9
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid "New Odoo customers with no existing products"
msgstr "Nya Odoo-kunder utan befintliga produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you are starting a new Odoo database and your products exist only on "
"Lazada, you can import your Lazada product catalog into Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Om du startar en ny Odoo-databas och dina produkter endast finns på Lazada "
"kan du importera din Lazada-produktkatalog till Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid ""
"In `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_, use "
"the :guilabel:`Bulk Manage` drop-down to export your product catalog, "
"including Lazada SKUs."
msgstr ""
"I `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_ använder du "
"rullgardinsmenyn :guilabel:`Bulk Manage` för att exportera din "
"produktkatalog, inklusive Lazada-enheter för lagerhållning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:23
msgid ""
"Import the exported catalog into Odoo via :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Products --> Import`. Map the Lazada SKU to the :guilabel:`Internal "
"Reference` field in Odoo to link your Lazada and Odoo products."
msgstr ""
"Importera den exporterade katalogen till Odoo via :menuselection:`Lager --> "
"Produkter --> Importera`. Mappa Lazada-enheten för lagerhållning till "
"fältet :guilabel:`Intern referens` i Odoo för att länka dina Lazada- och "
"Odoo-produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:26
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid "Existing Odoo customers with products already in Odoo"
msgstr "Befintliga Odoo-kunder med produkter redan i Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have an existing product catalog in Odoo, map your Lazada listings to "
"these products."
msgstr ""
"Om du har en befintlig produktkatalog i Odoo, mappa dina Lazada-listor till "
"dessa produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sync Product Catalogue` button in Odoo to automatically "
"match active Lazada products."
msgstr ""
"Använd knappen :guilabel:`Synkronisera produktkatalog` i Odoo för att "
"automatiskt matcha aktiva Lazada-produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:38
msgid ""
"Product catalog synchronization is an automated process initiated by the "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Produktkatalogsynkronisering är en automatiserad process som initieras av "
"synkroniseringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:43
msgid ""
"Orders are automatically fetched from Lazada and synchronized in Odoo at "
"regular intervals (every 60 minutes)."
msgstr ""
"Beställningar hämtas automatiskt från Lazada och synkroniseras i Odoo med "
"jämna intervall (var 60:e minut)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:46
msgid ""
"Only orders with status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` or :guilabel:`PROCESSED` "
"are fetched, as these require shipping action."
msgstr ""
"Endast ordrar med status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` "
"eller :guilabel:`PROCESSED` hämtas, eftersom dessa kräver fraktering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:48
msgid ""
"When an order is canceled on Lazada, its status updates in Odoo. However, "
"cancelling an order in Odoo does not reflect on Lazada."
msgstr ""
"När en order avbryts på Lazada uppdateras dess status i Odoo. Att avbryta en "
"order i Odoo återspeglas dock inte på Lazada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:50
msgid ""
"For each synchronized order, Odoo creates a sales order and a customer "
"(contact) if the customer has not been previously imported or does not exist "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"För varje synkroniserad order skapar Odoo en försäljningsorder och en kund "
"(kontakt) om kunden inte tidigare har importerats eller inte finns i "
"databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Only orders requiring shipment are synchronized. Orders with "
"statuses :guilabel:`SHIPPED`, :guilabel:`CANCEL`, :guilabel:`UNPAID`, "
"or :guilabel:`COMPLETED` are excluded during synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Endast beställningar som kräver leverans synkroniseras. Beställningar med "
"statusarna :guilabel:`SHIPPED`, :guilabel:`CANCEL`, :guilabel:`UNPAID` "
"eller :guilabel:`COMPLETED` exkluderas under synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:61
msgid ""
"To synchronize an order whose status hasn't changed since the last "
"synchronization:"
msgstr ""
"För att synkronisera en beställning vars status inte har ändrats sedan "
"senaste synkroniseringen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Lazada --> "
"Shops`."
msgstr ""
"Navigera till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Konfiguration --> Lazada --> "
"Butiker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the Lazada Shop and modify the :guilabel:`Last Order Sync` date "
"under :guilabel:`Synchronization Information` to a date prior to the order's "
"last status change."
msgstr ""
"Välj Lazada-butiken och ändra datumet :guilabel:`Senaste "
"ordersynkronisering` under :guilabel:`Synkroniseringsinformation` till ett "
"datum före beställningens senaste statusändring."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:66
msgid "Save to trigger synchronization."
msgstr "Spara för att utlösa synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:69
msgid ""
"In Debug Mode, access the Lazada shop in Odoo and click :guilabel:`Sync "
"Orders` to immediately synchronize orders or :guilabel:`Sync Inventory` for "
"inventory updates."
msgstr ""
"I Debug-läget öppnar du Lazada-butiken i Odoo och klickar på :guilabel:`Sync "
"Orders` för att omedelbart synkronisera ordrar eller :guilabel:`Sync "
"Inventory` för lageruppgraderingar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:75
msgid ""
"For :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)` orders, the **Lazada Connector** "
"creates a picking in the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, along with a sales "
"order and customer record, upon synchronization."
msgstr ""
"För :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)`-beställningar skapar **Lazada "
"Connector** en plockning i appen :menuselection:`Lager`, tillsammans med en "
"försäljningsorder och kundpost, vid synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:78
msgid ""
"Arrange by comfirming the picking in Odoo, then navigate to *Lazada Seller "
"Center* and click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to generate the tracking "
"number. Odoo retrieves the shipping label and attahces it to the "
"corresponding delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Ordna genom att bekräfta plockningen i Odoo, navigera sedan till *Lazada "
"Seller Center* och klicka på :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` för att skapa "
"spårningsnumret. Odoo hämtar fraktetiketten och bifogar den till motsvarande "
"leveransorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:81
msgid ""
"Validate the stock movement in Odoo to update inventory levels and confirm "
"the order has left the warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Validera lagerrörelsen i Odoo för att uppgradera lagernivåer och bekräfta "
"att ordern har lämnat lagret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:85
msgid "Lazada package statuses"
msgstr "Lazada-emballagestatus"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:87
msgid ""
"Understanding Lazada package statuses is crucial for effective order "
"management:"
msgstr ""
"Att förstå Lazada-emballagestatus är avgörande för effektiv orderhantering:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Pending on Lazada`: The package is awaiting receipt, "
"tagging, or processing in the warehouse system."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Package Pending on Lazada`: Emballaget väntar på mottagning, "
"taggning eller behandling i lagersystemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Confirmed on Lazada`: The package has been packed by the "
"seller or warehouse and is confirmed ready for courier pickup or dropoff. "
"Lazada is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Package Confirmed on Lazada`: Emballaget har packats av säljaren "
"eller lagret och är bekräftat klart för kurirens avhämtning eller avlämning. "
"Lazada meddelas och uppdaterar orderstatusen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ready to Ship on Lazada`: The order is ready for shipment. Lazada "
"is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ready to Ship on Lazada`: Ordern är klar för frakt. Lazada "
"meddelas och uppdaterar orderstatusen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivered on Lazada`: The parcel has been dropped off or picked "
"up by the logistics provider."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delivered on Lazada`: Paketet har lämnats av eller hämtats av "
"transportleverantören."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Canceled on Lazada`: The order has been canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Canceled on Lazada`: Ordern har avbrutits."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual handling required`: The package cannot be processed on "
"Odoo and requires manual handling on Lazada."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manual handling required`: Emballaget kan inte behandlas i Odoo "
"och kräver manuell hantering på Lazada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:103
msgid ""
"Lazada requires a tracking reference for each delivery. If the carrier "
"doesn't provide one automatically, set it manually in *Lazada Seller "
"Center*. Check supported logistics providers for your region (e.g., "
"Malaysia)."
msgstr ""
"Lazada kräver en spårningsreferens för varje leverans. Om transportföretaget "
"inte tillhandahåller en automatiskt, ställ in den manuellt i *Lazada Seller "
"Center*. Kontrollera stödda logistikleverantörer för din region (t.ex. "
"Malaysia)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:108
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:106
msgid "Order fulfillment process"
msgstr "Process för orderhantering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:110
msgid ""
"Lazada orders are automatically created in Odoo as sales orders. Select the "
"desired sales order in the **Sales app**."
msgstr ""
"Lazada-order skapas automatiskt i Odoo som försäljningsorder. Välj önskad "
"försäljningsorder i **Försäljningsappen**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:112
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to arrange shipment in the delivery "
"transfer if you are using supported logistics providers. Odoo imports the "
"shipping label (delivery note) and tracking number, associating them with "
"the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Packa Lazada-emballage` för att ordna leverans i "
"leveransöverföringen om du använder logistikleverantörer som stöds. Odoo "
"importerar fraktetiketten (leveransnota) och spårningsnumret och associerar "
"dem med försäljningsordern."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:115
msgid "Confirm the stock movement in Odoo to reduce inventory levels."
msgstr "Bekräfta lagerrörelsen i Odoo för att minska lagernivåerna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:120
msgid ""
"Due to Lazada's policy of not sharing customer email addresses, invoices "
"cannot be sent directly from Odoo. Instead:"
msgstr ""
"På grund av Lazadas policy att inte dela kunders e-postadresser kan fakturor "
"inte skickas direkt från Odoo. Istället:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:123
msgid ""
"Generate invoices in Odoo and manually upload them to *Lazada Seller Center*."
msgstr ""
"Skapa fakturor i Odoo och ladda upp dem manuellt till *Lazada Seller Center*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:124
msgid "Register Payments:"
msgstr "Registrera betalningar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:126
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated :guilabel:`Bank Journal` (e.g., \"Lazada Payments\") with "
"a Bank and Cash intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"Skapa en dedikerad :guilabel:`Bankjournal` (t.ex. \"Lazada Payments\") med "
"ett mellanliggande konto för bank och kontanter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:128
msgid ""
"Since Lazada processes batch payments weekly or monthly, select all invoices "
"linked to a payment in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom Lazada behandlar batchbetalningar veckovis eller månatligen, välj "
"alla fakturor kopplade till en betalning i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:130
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Batch Deposit` as the Payment Method, select the invoices, "
"and go to :menuselection:`Actions --> Create Batch Payment --> Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Använd :guilabel:`Batch-insättning` som betalningsmetod, välj fakturorna och "
"gå till :menuselection:`Åtgärder --> Skapa batchbetalning --> Validera`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:133
msgid ""
"Reconcile the payments after Lazada deposits the balance. Record it in the "
"bank statement and credit the Lazada intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"Stäm av betalningarna efter att Lazada har satt in saldot. Registrera det i "
"kontoutdraget och kreditera Lazadas mellankonto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:137
msgid "Apply the same process for vendor bills related to Lazada commissions."
msgstr ""
"Tillämpa samma process för leverantörsfakturor relaterade till Lazada-"
"provisioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:140
msgid "Analyzing Lazada sales with Odoo Reporting"
msgstr "Analysera Lazada-försäljning med Odoo Reporting"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:142
msgid ""
"Odoo's dashboard consolidates sales data from all channels. To analyze "
"Lazada sales specifically:"
msgstr ""
"Odoos dashboard sammanställer försäljningsdata från alla kanaler. För att "
"analysera Lazada-försäljning specifikt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:144
msgid "Set Up Sales Teams:"
msgstr "Installera säljteam:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:146
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Lazada --> Shops`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Försäljningsapp --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar "
"--> Anslutningar --> Lazada --> Butiker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:148
msgid ""
"Assign a dedicated sales team to each Lazada shop for isolated reporting."
msgstr ""
"Tilldela ett dedikerat säljteam till varje Lazada-butik för isolerad "
"rapportering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:150
msgid ""
"Use the dashboard filters to view sales data for the assigned Lazada sales "
"team."
msgstr ""
"Använd dashboardfiltren för att visa försäljningsdata för det tilldelade "
"Lazada-säljteamet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:153
msgid ""
"Configure separate sales teams for each Lazada marketplace to generate "
"detailed performance reports."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera separata säljteam för varje Lazada-marknad för att skapa "
"detaljerade prestandarapporter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:3
msgid "Lazada Connector configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration av Lazada-anslutning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to set up the **Lazada Connector** in Odoo to "
"integrate your Lazada Seller account(s) and manage multiple marketplaces "
"efficiently in Southeast Asia. Follow these steps to configure your account, "
"synchronize your product catalog, and prepare your shop for go-live."
msgstr ""
"Denna guide förklarar hur du installerar **Lazada Connector** i Odoo för att "
"integrera ditt Lazada Seller-konto/konton och hantera flera marknadsplatser "
"effektivt i Sydostasien. Följ dessa steg för att konfigurera ditt konto, "
"synkronisera din produktkatalog och förbereda din butik för driftsättning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:12
msgid "Before configuring the **Lazada Connector**, ensure you have:"
msgstr "Innan du konfigurerar **Lazada Connector**, se till att du har:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:14
msgid ""
"A Lazada Seller account (:guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed` "
"or :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`)."
msgstr ""
"Ett Lazada Seller-konto (:guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed` "
"eller :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:16
msgid "A valid email address and phone number for verification."
msgstr "En giltig e-postadress och telefonnummer för verifiering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:17
msgid ""
"A digital copy of your business license (for :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-"
"Developed` accounts)."
msgstr ""
"En digital kopia av din företagslicens (för :guilabel:`Egenskapad företag`-"
"konton)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:18
msgid ""
"A brief description of your integration purpose (e.g., \"Connecting Odoo ERP "
"to our Lazada store for order and inventory synchronization\")."
msgstr ""
"En kort beskrivning av syftet med din integration (t.ex. \"Ansluta Odoo "
"Affärsplanering till vår Lazada-butik för beställnings- och "
"lagersynkronisering\")."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:22
msgid ""
"The *Lazada Open Platform* account for API access is separate from your "
"*Lazada Seller account*."
msgstr ""
"*Lazada Open Platform*-kontot för programmeringsgränssnittåtkomst är separat "
"från ditt *Lazada-säljarkonto*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:25
msgid "Create a Lazada Open Platform account"
msgstr "Skapa ett Lazada Open Platform-konto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:27
msgid ""
"Open `Lazada Open Platform <https://open.lazada.com/>`_ and "
"click :guilabel:`Create Account` or :guilabel:`Sign Up`."
msgstr ""
"Öppna `Lazada Open Platform <https://open.lazada.com/>`_ och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa konto` eller :guilabel:`Registrera dig`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the profile and in the :guilabel:`Basic information`, begin "
"filling in the fields to start the registration process."
msgstr ""
"Gå till profilen och i :guilabel:`Grundläggande information`, börja fylla i "
"fälten för att starta registreringsprocessen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:32
msgid ""
"Under account information, select one of the following selections "
"for :guilabel:`Partner type`:"
msgstr ""
"Under kontoinformation, välj ett av följande alternativ "
"för :guilabel:`Partnertyp`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed`: For individuals without a business "
"license."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Egenskapad personlig`: För privatpersoner utan företagslicens."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`: For businesses with a registered "
"license."
