msgid ""
":guilabel:`Point of Sale`: select the :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)` in which "
"the program is valid and available. Leave this field empty to include "
"all :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Point of Sale`: välj den :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)` där "
"programmet är giltigt och tillgängligt. Lämna detta fält tomt för att "
"inkludera alla :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:61
msgid "eWallet program configuration page"
msgstr "Konfigurationssida för eWallet-programmet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once the program is configured, click the :guilabel:`Generate eWallet` "
"button in the upper-left corner to generate eWallets. eWallets can be "
"generated based on :guilabel:`Customers` and/or :guilabel:`Customer Tags`. "
"The quantity is automatically adapted according to the :guilabel:`Customers` "
"and :guilabel:`Customer Tags` selected. Then, set the :guilabel:`eWallet "
"value`. Finally, set the :guilabel:`Valid Until` period if applicable."
msgstr ""
"När programmet är konfigurerat klickar du på knappen :guilabel:`Generate "
"eWallet` i det övre vänstra hörnet för att generera eWallets. eWallets kan "
"genereras baserat på :guilabel:`Kunder` och/eller :guilabel:`Kundtaggar`. "
"Kvantiteten anpassas automatiskt efter de :guilabel:`Kunder` "
"och :guilabel:`Kundtaggar` som valts. Ställ sedan in :guilabel:`eWallet "
"value`. Slutligen anger du perioden :guilabel:`Valid Until` om tillämpligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:71
msgid ""
"Generated eWallets can be accessed through the :guilabel:`eWallets` smart "
"button in the upper-right corner. From there, :guilabel:`Send` "
"or :guilabel:`Share` the eWallets via email or a URL link."
msgstr ""
"De genererade eWallets kan nås via smartknappen :guilabel:`eWallets` i det "
"övre högra hörnet. Därifrån kan du :guilabel:`Send` eller :guilabel:`Share` "
"eWallets via e-post eller en URL-länk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:74
msgid "eWallets send and share buttons"
msgstr "eWallets knappar för att skicka och dela"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:78
msgid ""
"Click on an eWallet to change the :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Partner`, or :guilabel:`Balance`. The :guilabel:`Code` of "
"an eWallet *cannot* be changed, deleted, or duplicated."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på en eWallet för att ändra :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Partner`, eller :guilabel:`Balance`. En :guilabel:`Code` "
"för en eWallet *kan* inte ändras, raderas eller dupliceras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:86
msgid ""
"Gift cards can be purchased by customers, and in turn used as a payment "
"method upon checkout at an eCommerce shop or :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)`."
msgstr ""
"Presentkort kan köpas av kunder och i sin tur användas som betalningsmetod "
"vid utcheckningen i en e-handelsbutik eller :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:89
msgid ""
"Before creating a new gift card program, it is necessary to first create "
"gift cards as products. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products` and :guilabel:`Create` a product. On the product "
"template, configure the options as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Innan du skapar ett nytt presentkortsprogram måste du först skapa "
"presentkort som produkter. Detta gör du genom att gå "
"till :menuselection:`Försäljningsapp --> Produkter --> Produkter` "
"och :guilabel:`Skapa` en produkt. Konfigurera alternativen i produktmallen "
"enligt följande:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:93
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Name`: enter a name for the gift card product"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Produktnamn`: ange ett namn för presentkortsprodukten"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales Price`: enter the amount of the gift card"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Säljpris`: ange beloppet för presentkortet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:101
msgid ""
"In order to have gift cards of different amounts, create multiple gift card "
"products and modify the :guilabel:`Sales Price` accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill ha presentkort med olika belopp skapar du flera "
"presentkortsprodukter och ändrar :guilabel:`Säljpris` i enlighet med detta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:104
msgid ""
"Once the gift card product is created, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Gift cards & eWallet` to :guilabel:`Create` a gift card "
"program. The following configuration options are available:"
msgstr ""
"När presentkortsprodukten har skapats går du till :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Products --> Gift cards & eWallet` för att :guilabel:`Create` ett "
"presentkortsprogram. Följande konfigurationsalternativ är tillgängliga:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:108
msgid ":guilabel:`Program Name`: enter a name for the gift card program"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Programnamn`: ange ett namn för presentkortsprogrammet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:109
msgid ":guilabel:`Program Type`: select :guilabel:`Gift Card`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Program typ`: välj :guilabel:`Gift Card`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gift Card Products`: select the gift card product created "
"earlier. Repeat the process if you created gift card products of different "
"amounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Presentkortsprodukter`: välj den presentkortsprodukt som skapades "
"tidigare. Upprepa processen om du har skapat presentkortsprodukter med olika "
"belopp."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email template`: select the default :guilabel:`Gift Card: Gift "
"Card Information` template, or create a new template by clicking on the "
"field, selecting :guilabel:`Search More`, and then "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`E-postmall`: välj standardmallen :guilabel:`Gåvokort: "
"Presentkortsinformation`, eller skapa en ny mall genom att klicka på fältet, "
"välja :guilabel:`Sök mer`, och sedan klicka på :guilabel:`Create`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:115
msgid ":guilabel:`Print Report`: select :guilabel:`Gift Card`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Print Report`: välj :guilabel:`Gift Card`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: select the currency to use for the gift card program"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: välj den valuta som ska användas för "
"presentkortsprogrammet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:124
msgid "Gift card program configuration page"
msgstr "Konfigurationssida för presentkortsprogram"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:128
msgid ""
"Once the program is configured, click the :guilabel:`Generate Gift Cards` "
"button in the upper-left corner to generate gift cards. Gift cards can be "
"generated either for :guilabel:`Anonymous Customers` or :guilabel:`Selected "
"Customers`. Set the :guilabel:`Quantity to generate` "
"for :guilabel:`Anonymous Customers`, or select the :guilabel:`Customers` and/"
"or :guilabel:`Customer Tags` for :guilabel:`Selected Customers`. Then, set "
"the :guilabel:`Gift Card value`. Finally, set the :guilabel:`Valid Until` "
"period if applicable."
msgstr ""
"När programmet är konfigurerat klickar du på knappen :guilabel:`Generera "
"presentkort` i det övre vänstra hörnet för att generera presentkort. "
"Presentkort kan genereras antingen för :guilabel:`Anonyma kunder` "
"eller :guilabel:`Valda kunder`. Ställ in :guilabel:`Quantity to generate` "
"för :guilabel:`Anonymous Customers`, eller välj :guilabel:`Customers` och/"
"eller :guilabel:`Customer Tags` för :guilabel:`Selected Customers`. Ange "
"sedan :guilabel:`Giftkortets värde`. Slutligen anger du "
"perioden :guilabel:`Valid Until` om tillämpligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:135
msgid ""
"Generated gift cards can be accessed through the :guilabel:`Gift Cards` "
"smart button in the upper-right corner. From there, :guilabel:`Send` "
"or :guilabel:`Share` the gift cards via email or a URL link."
msgstr ""
"Genererade presentkort kan nås via smartknappen :guilabel:`Gift Cards` i det "
"övre högra hörnet. Därifrån kan du :guilabel:`Skicka` eller :guilabel:`Dela` "
"presentkorten via e-post eller en URL-länk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:139
msgid "Gift cards send and share buttons"
msgstr "Skicka och dela-knappar för presentkort"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:143
msgid ""
"Click on a gift card to change the :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Partner`, or :guilabel:`Balance`. The :guilabel:`Code` of "
"a gift card *cannot* be changed, deleted, or duplicated."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ett presentkort för att ändra :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Partner` eller :guilabel:`Balance`. Ett "
"presentkorts :guilabel:`Kod` *kan* inte ändras, raderas eller dupliceras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Configure discount and loyalty programs in Odoo Sales, Subscriptions, "
"eCommerce, and Point of Sale, including program types, conditional rules, "
"and rewards, to offer customers varied and time-sensitive pricing beyond "
"standard pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera rabatt- och lojalitetsprogram i Odoo Försäljning, "
"Prenumerationer, e-handel och Kassasystem, inklusive programtyper, "
"villkorsregler och belöningar, för att erbjuda kunder varierade och "
"tidsbegränsade priser utöver standardprislistor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Sales**, **Subscriptions**, **eCommerce**, and **Point of Sale** "
"applications allow users to create discount and loyalty programs that "
"customers can use for online and in-store shopping. These programs offer "
"more varied, public, and time-sensitive pricing options "
"than :doc:`pricelists </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-apparna **Försäljning**, **Prenumerationer**, **e-handel** och "
"**Kassasystem** gör det möjligt för användare att skapa rabatt- och "
"lojalitetsprogram som kunder kan använda vid köp online och i butik. Dessa "
"program erbjuder mer varierade, allmänna och tidsbegränsade prisalternativ "
"än :doc:`prislistor </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:18
msgid "Configure the settings"
msgstr "Konfigurera inställningarna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:20
msgid ""
"To begin using discount and loyalty programs, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Pricing` heading, activate the :guilabel:`Promotions, Loyalty "
"& Gift Card` setting by checking the box next to the feature. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"För att börja använda rabatt- och lojalitetsprogram navigerar du till "
":menuselection:`Försäljning --&gt; Konfiguration --&gt; Inställningar`. "
"Under rubriken :guilabel:`Prissättning` aktiverar du inställningen "
":guilabel:`Kampanjer, lojalitet och presentkort` genom att markera "
"kryssrutan bredvid funktionen. Klicka slutligen på :guilabel:`Spara` för att "
"spara ändringarna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:28
msgid "Configure discount and loyalty programs"
msgstr "Konfigurera rabatt- och lojalitetsprogram"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:30
msgid ""
"To create discount and loyalty programs, go to :menuselection:`Sales --> "
"Promotions --> Discount & Loyalty`. From this screen, a discount & loyalty "
"program can be created from scratch, or one of seven templates may be chosen "
"as a starting point. Templates include:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa rabatt- och lojalitetsprogram går du till "
":menuselection:`Försäljning --> Kampanjer --> Rabatt och lojalitet`. Från "
"denna skärm kan ett rabatt- och lojalitetsprogram skapas från grunden, eller "
"så kan en av sju mallar väljas som utgångspunkt. Mallarna inkluderar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promotional Program`: A promotion where a discount of 10% is "
"automatically granted on orders over $50."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampanjprogram`: En kampanj där en rabatt på 10 % automatiskt "
"beviljas på beställningar över 50 USD."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promo Code`: A promotion with a code for 10% off select products."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampanjkod`: En kampanj med en kod som ger 10 % rabatt på utvalda "
"produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Buy X, Get Y`: A promotion to buy 2 products and get the 3rd for "
"free."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Köp X, få Y`: En kampanj för att köpa 2 produkter och få den 3:e "
"gratis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Order Coupon`: A promotion where a coupon with a discount "
"valid on the next purchase is sent after an order is completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kupong för nästa beställning`: En kampanj där en kupong med "
"rabatt som gäller vid nästa köp skickas efter att en order har slutförts."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Loyalty Card`: A promotion where customers earn points with each "
"purchase that can be exchanged for gifts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lojalitetskort`: En kampanj där kunder tjänar poäng vid varje köp "
"som kan bytas mot gåvor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Coupon`: A promotion to generate and share unique coupon codes "
"with customers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kupong`: En kampanj för att generera och dela unika kupongkoder "
"med kunder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fidelity Card`: A promotion where customers who buy 10 products "
"over time get a discount on their 11th purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stamkundskort`: En kampanj där kunder som köper 10 produkter över "
"tid får rabatt på sitt 11:e köp."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:46
msgid ""
"New programs can be created by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button. Existing "
"programs can be edited by selecting them. Creating or editing a program "
"opens the program form."
msgstr ""
"Nya program kan skapas genom att klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Ny`. "
"Befintliga program kan redigeras genom att välja dem. När du skapar eller "
"redigerar ett program öppnas programformuläret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:49
msgid "Program options on the loyalty program form."
msgstr "Programalternativ på lojalitetsprogrammets formulär."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:52
msgid ""
"The program form typically contains the following fields. The options "
"available may vary depending on the :ref:`Program Type <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/program-types>` selected and the applications installed in "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"Programformuläret innehåller vanligtvis följande fält. De tillgängliga "
"alternativen kan variera beroende på vilken :ref:`Programtyp <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/program-types>` som valts och vilka appar som är "
"installerade i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Program Name`: Enter the name of the program in this field. The "
"program name is **not** visible to the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Programnamn`: Ange namnet på programmet i detta fält. "
"Programnamnet är **inte** synligt för kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Select the desired :ref:`program type <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/program-types>` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Programtyp`: Välj önskad :ref:`programtyp <sales/loyalty_discount/"
"program-types>` i rullgardinsmenyn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Limit Usage`: If desired, select this checkbox, and enter a "
"number of :guilabel:`usages` to limit the number of times the program's "
"benefits can be used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Begränsa användning`: Markera denna kryssruta om så önskas och "
"ange ett antal :guilabel:`användningar` för att begränsa hur många gånger "
"programmets förmåner kan utnyttjas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Availability Dates`: Select the date from which the program is "
"available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tillgänglighetsdatum`: Välj det datum från vilket programmet är "
"tillgängligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:64
msgid ""
"Additional fields may appear in the program form depending on which apps are "
"installed to the database and if the form is for a new program or an "
"existing one. Other commonly encountered fields include:"
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare fält kan visas i programformuläret beroende på vilka appar som "
"är installerade i databasen och om formuläret gäller ett nytt eller ett "
"befintligt program. Andra vanligt förekommande fält inkluderar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`For`: Specify one or more pricelists for this loyalty program to "
"apply to. When a single loyalty program is linked to several pricelists, it "
"makes it viable for different customer segments to have different "
"pricelists, but the *same* loyalty programs. If this field is left blank, "
"the program is applied to everyone, regardless of pricelist."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`För`: Ange en eller flera prislistor som detta lojalitetsprogram "
"ska gälla för. När ett enskilt lojalitetsprogram kopplas till flera "
"prislistor gör det möjligt för olika kundsegment att ha olika prislistor, "
"men *samma* lojalitetsprogram. Om detta fält lämnas tomt tillämpas "
"programmet för alla, oavsett prislista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Enter the name of the points used for "
"the :guilabel:`Loyalty Card` program (e.g. `Loyalty Points`). Points unit "
"names are visible to the customer. This field is **only** available when "
"the :guilabel:`Program Type` is set to :guilabel:`Loyalty Card`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Typ`: Ange namnet på de poäng som används för programmet "
":guilabel:`Lojalitetskort` (t.ex. `Lojalitetspoäng`). Poängenhetsnamn är "
"synliga för kunden. Detta fält är **endast** tillgängligt när "
":guilabel:`Programtyp` är inställt på :guilabel:`Lojalitetskort`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Points Validity`: Set the number of days before earned points "
"expire. Setting this field to 0 ensures points have no expiration date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Poänggiltighet`: Ange antalet dagar innan intjänade poäng "
"förfaller. Om fältet sätts till 0 saknar poängen utgångsdatum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:78
msgid ""
"All of the existing cards, codes, coupons, etc. that have been generated for "
"the program are accessible through the smart button located at the top of "
"the form. Loyalty card history lines display a date on which points expire. "
"Customers can see point expiration dates in their portals. When customers "
"use points, the soonest-to-expire points are used first. Expired points do "
"not count towards a card's balance."
msgstr ""
"Alla befintliga kort, koder, kuponger etc. som har genererats för programmet "
"är tillgängliga via den smarta knappen högst upp i formuläret. Historikrader "
"för lojalitetskort visar det datum då poängen förfaller. Kunder kan se "
"poängens utgångsdatum i sina portaler. När kunder använder poäng används de "
"som förfaller tidigast först. Förfallna poäng räknas inte in i kortets saldo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:87
msgid "Program types"
msgstr "Typer av program"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:89
msgid ""
"The different :guilabel:`Program Types` available on the program form are:"
msgstr ""
"De olika :guilabel:`Programtyperna` som finns tillgängliga på "
"programformuläret är:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Coupons`: Generate and share single-use coupon codes that grant "
"immediate access to rewards."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kuponger`: Skapa och dela kupongkoder för engångsbruk som ger "
"omedelbar tillgång till belöningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Loyalty Cards`: When making purchases, the customer accumulates "
"points to exchange for rewards on current and/or future orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Loyalitetskort`: Vid köp samlar kunden poäng som kan bytas mot "
"belöningar på nuvarande och/eller framtida beställningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promotions`: Set conditional rules for ordering products, which, "
"when fulfilled, grant access to rewards for the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Promotions`: Ställ in villkorliga regler för beställning av "
"produkter, som, när de uppfylls, ger kunden tillgång till belöningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Discount Code`: Set codes which, when entered upon checkout, "
"grant discounts to the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rabattkod`: Ange koder som, när de anges i kassan, ger rabatter "
"till kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Buy X Get Y`: for every (X) item bought, the customer is granted "
"1 credit. After accumulating a specified amount of credits, the customer can "
"trade them in to receive (Y) item."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Buy X Get Y`: för varje (X) vara som köps får kunden 1 kredit. "
"Efter att ha samlat på sig ett visst antal krediter kan kunden byta in dem "
"mot (Y) föremål."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Order Coupons`: Generate and share single-use coupon codes "
"that grant access to rewards on the customer's next order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kuponger för nästa beställning`: Skapa och dela kupongkoder för "
"engångsbruk som ger tillgång till belöningar på kundens nästa beställning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:107
msgid "Conditional rules"
msgstr "Villkorliga regler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:109
msgid ""
"Next, configure the :guilabel:`Conditional rules` that determine when the "
"program applies to a customer's order. In the *Rules & Rewards* tab, "
"click :guilabel:`+ Add a rule` under :guilabel:`Conditional rules` to add "
"*rules* to the program. This opens the *Create Conditional rules* pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera sedan de :guilabel:`Villkorsregler` som avgör när programmet "
"gäller för en kundorder. På fliken *Regler och belöningar* klickar du på "
":guilabel:`+ Lägg till en regel` under :guilabel:`Villkorsregler` för att "
"lägga till *regler* i programmet. Detta öppnar popup-fönstret *Skapa "
"villkorsregler*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:114
msgid ""
"The following options are available for configuring conditional rules. The "
"options available in this window may change depending on the program type, "
"the apps installed to the database, and other factors:"
msgstr ""
"Följande alternativ är tillgängliga för att konfigurera villkorsregler. "
"Alternativen i detta fönster kan variera beroende på programtyp, vilka appar "
"som är installerade i databasen och andra faktorer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Discount Code`: Enter a custom code to be used for "
"the :guilabel:`Discount Code` program, or use the default one generated by "
"Odoo. This field is only available when the :guilabel:`Program Type` is set "
"to :guilabel:`Discount Code`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rabattkod`: Ange en egen kod som ska användas "
"för :guilabel:`Discount Code`-programmet, eller använd standardkoden som "
"genereras av Odoo. Detta fält är endast tillgängligt "
"när :guilabel:`Programtyp` är inställd på :guilabel:`Rabattkod`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Quantity`: Enter the minimum number of products that must "
"be purchased in order to access the reward. Set the minimum quantity to at "
"least `1` to ensure that the customer must make a purchase in order to "
"access the reward."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Minsta antal`: Ange det minsta antal produkter som måste köpas "
"för att få tillgång till belöningen. Ange minsta antal till minst `1` för "
"att säkerställa att kunden måste göra ett köp för att få tillgång till "
"belöningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Purchase`: Enter the minimum amount (in currency), "
"with :guilabel:`tax included` or :guilabel:`tax excluded`, that must be "
"spent in order to access the reward. If both a minimum quantity *and* "
"minimum purchase amount are entered, then the customer's order must meet "
"both conditions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Minsta inköp`: Ange det minsta belopp (i valuta), med "
":guilabel:`skatt inkluderad` eller :guilabel:`skatt exkluderad`, som måste "
"spenderas för att få tillgång till belöningen. Om både minsta antal *och* "
"minsta inköpsbelopp anges måste kundens beställning uppfylla båda villkoren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Products`: Select the specific product(s) for which the program "
"applies. Leave this field blank to apply it to all products."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkter`: Välj den eller de specifika produkter som programmet "
"gäller för. Lämna detta fält tomt för att tillämpa det på alla produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Categories`: Select the category of products for which the "
"program applies. Choose :guilabel:`All` to apply it to all product "
"categories."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kategorier`: Välj den produktkategori som programmet gäller för. "
"Välj :guilabel:`All` för att tillämpa det på alla produktkategorier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Tag`: Select a tag to apply the program to products with "
"that specific tag."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkttagg:` Välj en tagg för att tillämpa programmet på "
"produkter med den specifika taggen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Grant`: Enter the number of points the customer "
"earns :guilabel:`per order`, :guilabel:`per currency spent`, "
"or :guilabel:`per unit paid` (for the :guilabel:`Loyalty Cards` "
"and :guilabel:`Buy X Get Y` programs)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Grant`: Ange antalet poäng som kunden tjänar :guilabel:`per "
"order`, :guilabel:`per spenderad valuta`, eller :guilabel:`per betald enhet` "
"(för programmen :guilabel:`Loyalty Cards` och :guilabel:`Buy X Get Y`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:137
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to save the rule and close the pop-up window, "
"or click :guilabel:`Save & New` to save the rule and immediately create a "
"new one. Click :guilabel:`Discard` to close the window without saving "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Spara och stäng` för att spara regeln och stänga popup-"
"fönstret, eller klicka på :guilabel:`Spara och ny` för att spara regeln och "
"omedelbart skapa en ny. Klicka på :guilabel:`Avbryt` för att stänga fönstret "
"utan att spara ändringarna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:144
msgid "Rewards"
msgstr "Belöningar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:146
msgid ""
"In the *Rules & Rewards* tab of the program form, click :guilabel:`+ Add a "
"reward` next to :guilabel:`Rewards` to add *rewards* to the program. This "
"reveals the *Create Rewards* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Under fliken *Regler och belöningar* i programformuläret klickar du på "
":guilabel:`Lägg till` bredvid :guilabel:`Belöningar` för att lägga till "
"*belöningar* i programmet. Detta öppnar popup-fönstret *Skapa belöningar*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:150
msgid ""
"The following options are available for configuring rewards. The options "
"available in this window may change depending on the program type, the apps "
"installed to the database, and other factors:"
msgstr ""
"Följande alternativ är tillgängliga för att konfigurera belöningar. "
"Alternativen i detta fönster kan variera beroende på programtyp, vilka appar "
"som är installerade i databasen och andra faktorer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reward Type`: Select the reward type among :guilabel:`Free "
"Product`, :guilabel:`Discount`, and :guilabel:`Free Shipping`. The other "
"options for reward configuration depend on the :guilabel:`Reward Type` "
"selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Typ av belöning`: Välj belöningstyp bland :guilabel:`Free "
"Product`, :guilabel:`Discount` och :guilabel:`Free Shipping`. De andra "
"alternativen för belöningskonfiguration beror på den :guilabel:`Reward Type` "
"som valts."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:157
msgid ":guilabel:`Free Product`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fri produkt`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:159
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity Rewarded`: Select the number of free products rewarded "
"to the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kvantitet som belönas`: Välj antalet gratis produkter som belönas "
"till kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Select the product given for free as a reward. Only one "
"product can be selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkt`: Välj den produkt som ges gratis som belöning. Endast en "
"produkt kan väljas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Tag`: Select a tag to further specify the free product "
"eligible for the reward."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkttagg`: Välj en tagg för att ytterligare specificera den "
"kostnadsfria produkten som är berättigad till belöningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:165
msgid ":guilabel:`Discount`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Rabatt`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Discount`: Enter the discounted amount in "
"either :guilabel:`%`, :guilabel:`$`, or :guilabel:`$ per point`. Then, "
"select whether the discount applies to the entire :guilabel:`Order`, "
"the :guilabel:`Cheapest Product` on the order, or only :guilabel:`Specific "
"Products`. If :doc:`developer mode </applications/general/developer_mode>` "
"is active, the reward can be set to apply to the :guilabel:`Cheapest "
"Product` in a specific domain (for example, the cheapest t-shirt when there "
"are multiple types of clothing in a sales order)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rabatt`: Ange det rabatterade beloppet i antingen :guilabel:`%`, "
":guilabel:`$` eller :guilabel:`$ per poäng`. Välj sedan om rabatten gäller "
"för hela :guilabel:`Order`, :guilabel:`Billigaste produkt` i ordern, eller "
"endast :guilabel:`Specifika produkter`. Om :doc:`utvecklarläget </"
"applications/general/developer_mode>` är aktivt kan belöningen ställas in på "
"att gälla för :guilabel:`Billigaste produkt` inom en specifik domän (till "
"exempel den billigaste t-shirten när det finns flera typer av kläder i en "
"försäljningsorder)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:173
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:180
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Max Discount`: Enter the maximum amount (in currency) that this "
"reward may grant as a discount. Leave this field at `0` for no limit."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Max Rabatt`: Ange det högsta belopp (i valuta) som denna belöning "
"kan ge som rabatt. Lämna detta fält på `0` för ingen gräns."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Free Shipping`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fri frakt`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description on order`: Enter the description that appears on the "
"order form when this discount is applied."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Beskrivning på order`: Ange den beskrivning som visas på "
"orderformuläret när denna rabatt tillämpas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:186
msgid "Additional program options are available under the *Settings* tab."
msgstr "Ytterligare programalternativ finns under fliken *Inställningar*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available On`: Set the apps that this loyalty program is "
"available on."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tillgänglig på`: Ange vilka appar som detta lojalitetsprogram är "
"tillgängligt i."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Website`: Select a website on which the program is available. If "
"this field is left blank, this program is available on all websites."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Webbplats`: Välj en webbplats där programmet ska vara "
"tillgängligt. Om detta fält lämnas tomt är programmet tillgängligt på alla "
"webbplatser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Point of Sale`: Select the points of sale at which the program is "
"available. If this field is left blank, this program is available at "
"all :abbr:`PoS (Point of Sale)` stations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kassa`: Välj de kassor där programmet ska vara tillgängligt. Om "
"detta fält lämnas tomt är programmet tillgängligt vid alla :abbr:`PoS (Point "
"of Sale)`-stationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Choose the company for which this program is available, "
"if working in a multi-company database. If this field is left blank, the "
"program is available to all companies in the database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Företag`: Välj det företag som detta program ska vara "
"tillgängligt för, om du arbetar i en databas med flera företag. Om detta "
"fält lämnas tomt är programmet tillgängligt för alla företag i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices.rst:5
msgid "Manage your pricing"
msgstr "Hantera din prissättning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:3
msgid "Foreign currencies"
msgstr "Utländska valutor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:5
msgid ""
"With Odoo, pricelists can be used to manage prices in a number of foreign "
"currencies. Specifically, Odoo has the ability to work with 167 total "
"currencies."
msgstr ""
"Med Odoo kan prislistor användas för att hantera priser i ett antal "
"utländska valutor. Specifikt har Odoo möjlighet att arbeta med 167 totala "
"valutor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:9
msgid ""
"In order to use multiple currencies in Odoo *Sales*, the *Accounting* "
"application **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"För att kunna använda flera valutor i Odoo *Sales* måste programmet "
"*Accounting* **vara** installerat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:15
msgid ""
"Once the *Accounting* app has been installed, foreign currencies can be "
"added to the database. Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Currencies` section, "
"and locate the :guilabel:`Main Currency` setting."
msgstr ""
"När appen *Accounting* har installerats kan utländska valutor läggas till i "
"databasen. Gå till :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, bläddra till avsnittet :guilabel:`Currencies` och leta reda på "
"inställningen :guilabel:`Main Currency`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:19
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:33
msgid ""
"How the main currency feature appears on settings page in Odoo Accounting."
msgstr ""
"Hur huvudvalutafunktionen visas på inställningssidan i Odoo Accounting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:23
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically sets the main currency as the currency of the country the "
"company is based in."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ställer automatiskt in huvudvalutan som valutan i det land där "
"företaget är baserat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:25
msgid ""
"To change the main currency of the company, select the drop-down menu in "
"the :guilabel:`Currency` field, select the desired currency, and be sure "
"to :guilabel:`Save` the changes."
msgstr ""
"För att ändra företagets huvudvaluta, välj rullgardinsmenyn i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Currency`, välj önskad valuta och var noga med "
"att :guilabel:`Save` ändringarna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:29
msgid ""
"To ensure currency rates are updated automatically, enable the *automatic "
"currency rates* feature on the *Accounting* settings page "
"(:menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Currencies section`)."
msgstr ""
"För att säkerställa att valutakurser uppdateras automatiskt, aktivera "
"funktionen *automatiska valutakurser* på inställningssidan för *Redovisning* "
"(:menuselection:`Redovisningsapp --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar --> "
"Avsnitt om valutor`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:37
msgid ""
"Click the checkbox beside the :guilabel:`Automatic Currency Rates` feature, "
"choose a designated bank to get the currency rates from in "
"the :guilabel:`Service` field drop-down menu, and select "
"an :guilabel:`Interval` of time for the updates to take place. Then "
"determine when the date of the :guilabel:`Next Run` should be."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på kryssrutan bredvid funktionen :guilabel:`Automatiska "
"valutakurser`, välj en bank att hämta valutakurserna från i "
"rullgardinsmenyn :guilabel:`Tjänst` och välj ett :guilabel:`Intervall` för "
"uppdateringarna. Bestäm sedan när datumet för :guilabel:`Next Run` ska vara."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:42
msgid ""
"To instantly update the currency rates, click the :guilabel:`🔁 (circular "
"arrows)` icon, located to the right of the :guilabel:`Next Run` field."
msgstr ""
"För att omedelbart uppdatera valutakurserna, klicka på :guilabel:`🔁 "
"(cirkulära pilar)` ikonen, som finns till höger om :guilabel:`Next Run` "
"fältet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:45
msgid ""
"When all configurations are complete, be sure to :guilabel:`Save` all "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"När alla konfigurationer är klara, se till att :guilabel:`Spara` alla "
"ändringar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:48
msgid ""
"All payment methods **must** be in the same currency as the sales journal, "
"or the company currency, if the company currency is not set. If it is not "
"the same, a :guilabel:`Validation Error` message appears."
msgstr ""
"Alla betalningsmetoder **måste** vara i samma valuta som "
"försäljningsjournalen, eller företagets valuta, om företagets valuta inte är "
"inställd. Om det inte är samma valuta visas ett :guilabel:`Valideringsfel`-"
"meddelande."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:53
msgid "View, edit, and add currencies"
msgstr "Visa, redigera och lägga till valutor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:55
msgid ""
"To view, edit, and add currencies to the database, making them available on "
"pricelists and on the :guilabel:`Main Currency` drop-down menu, click "
"the :guilabel:`Currencies` link, located beneath the :guilabel:`Currency` "
"field on the :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Settings` page."
msgstr ""
"För att visa, redigera och lägga till valutor i databasen, så att de blir "
"tillgängliga i prislistor och i rullgardinsmenyn :guilabel:`Huvudvaluta`, "
"klicka på länken :guilabel:`Valutor`, som finns under "
"fältet :guilabel:`Valuta` på sidan :menuselection:`Räkenskapsprogram --> "
"Inställningar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:59
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Currencies` link is clicked, a "
"separate :guilabel:`Currencies` page is revealed."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på länken :guilabel:`Currencies` visas en "
"separat :guilabel:`Currencies`-sida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:61
msgid "How the main currencies page appears in Odoo Accounting."
msgstr "Hur huvudsidan för valutor visas i Odoo Accounting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:65
msgid ""
"On this page, Odoo provides a master list of 167 global currencies. Each row "
"shows the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Currency`, :guilabel:`Symbol`, :guilabel:`Name`, "
"date of the :guilabel:`Last Update`, and :guilabel:`Current Rate` (compared "
"to the default currency of the country in which the company is based)."
msgstr ""
"På den här sidan tillhandahåller Odoo en huvudlista med 167 globala valutor. "
"Varje rad visar "
"motsvarande :guilabel:`Currency`, :guilabel:`Symbol`, :guilabel:`Name`, "
"datum för :guilabel:`Last Update` och :guilabel:`Current Rate` (jämfört med "
"standardvalutan i det land där företaget har sitt säte)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:70
msgid ""
"To the far right, there are two columns, which can be toggled on or off:"
msgstr ""
"Längst till höger finns två kolumner som kan aktiveras eller inaktiveras:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: this currency is activated, which means it can be added "
"to a pricelist, or used as the main currency of the company, if desired "
"(via :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Currencies section`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Active`: denna valuta är aktiverad, vilket innebär att den kan "
"läggas till i en prislista eller användas som företagets huvudvaluta, om så "
"önskas (via :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings --"
"> Currencies section`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:77
msgid ""
"By default, all the :guilabel:`Active` currency options are at the top of "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"Som standard är alla :guilabel:`Aktiva` valutaalternativ överst i listan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:80
msgid ""
"It is recommended that *at least* one pricelist is created "
"per :guilabel:`Active` currency. See :doc:`./pricing` to learn more about "
"pricelist configuration."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att *minst* en prislista skapas per :guilabel:`Active` "
"valuta. Se :doc:`./pricing` för mer information om konfigurering av "
"prislistor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:83
msgid ""
"To toggle options on/off, click the toggle switch in the row for the "
"corresponding column. When *on* the color of the switch is green. When "
"*off*, the color of the switch is grey."
msgstr ""
"För att växla alternativ till/från, klicka på växlingsknappen i raden för "
"motsvarande kolumn. När *på* är färgen på omkopplaren grön. När den är *av* "
"är färgen på omkopplaren grå."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:87
msgid "Currency detail form"
msgstr "Formulär för valutauppgifter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:89
msgid ""
"To edit any currency on the :guilabel:`Currencies` page, click the desired "
"currency to reveal the detail form for that specific currency, and proceed "
"to make any necessary changes."
msgstr ""
"För att redigera en valuta på sidan :guilabel:`Currencies`, klicka på önskad "
"valuta för att visa detaljformuläret för den specifika valutan, och fortsätt "
"med att göra nödvändiga ändringar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:92
msgid "How a currency detail form looks in Odoo Accounting."
msgstr "Hur ett formulär för valutadetaljer ser ut i Odoo Accounting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:96
msgid ""
"On the currency detail form, the relevant currency code appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Currency` field. Beneath that, the name for the currency is "
"in the :guilabel:`Name` field."
msgstr ""
"I formuläret för valutadetaljer visas den relevanta valutakoden i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Currency`. Under detta visas namnet på valutan i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Name`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:99
msgid ""
"Then, toggle the currency's availability with the :guilabel:`Active` toggle: "
"*on* is indicated with a green switch, and *off* is indicated with a grey "
"switch."
msgstr ""
"Växla sedan valutans tillgänglighet med :guilabel:`Active`: *på* indikeras "
"med en grön strömbrytare, och *av* indikeras med en grå strömbrytare."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:102
msgid ""
"On the right of the currency detail form, the "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Currency Unit` (e.g. `Dollars`) "
"and :guilabel:`Currency Subunit` (e.g. `Cents`) can be found."
msgstr ""
"Till höger om formuläret för valutauppgifter finns :guilabel:`Valutaenhet` "
"(t.ex. `Dollar`) och :guilabel:`Valutaunderenhet` (t.ex. `Cent`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:105
msgid ""
"Next, under the :guilabel:`Rates` tab, the various conversion rates can be "
"viewed, added, or deleted. Each row shows the :guilabel:`Date` of that "
"specific rate, the :guilabel:`Company` to which it is connected, followed by "
"the :guilabel:`Unit per...` and :guilabel:`...per Unit`."
msgstr ""
"Under fliken :guilabel:`Rates` kan du sedan visa, lägga till eller ta bort "
"de olika konverteringskurserna. Varje rad visar :guilabel:`Datum` för den "
"specifika kursen, :guilabel:`Företag` som den är kopplad till, följt "
"av :guilabel:`Enhet per...` och :guilabel:`...per enhet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:110
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:158
msgid ""
"The *...* in each of the last two columns represents the main currency set "
"for the company. For example, if the main currency is set to `USD`, the "
"columns are titled :guilabel:`Unit per USD` and :guilabel:`USD per Unit`."
msgstr ""
"*...* i var och en av de två sista kolumnerna representerar företagets "
"huvudvaluta. Om huvudvalutan t.ex. är `USD` har kolumnerna "
"titlarna :guilabel:`Enhet per USD` och :guilabel:`USD per enhet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:114
msgid ""
"To add a new rate, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the :guilabel:`Rates` "
"tab, and proceed to fill in the necessary information in the aforementioned "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"För att lägga till en ny taxa, klicka på :guilabel:`Add a line` i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Rates` och fyll i nödvändig information i de ovan nämnda "
"kolumnerna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:118
msgid "Main currency detail form"
msgstr "Formulär för uppgifter om huvudvaluta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:120
msgid ""
"If the selected currency is the main currency of the company, a blue banner "
"appears at the top of the currency detail form with the "
"message: :guilabel:`This is your company's currency.`."
msgstr ""
"Om den valda valutan är företagets huvudvaluta visas en blå banner högst upp "
"i formuläret för valutauppgifter med meddelandet: :guilabel:`Detta är ditt "
"företags valuta.`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:123
msgid "How a main currency detail form looks in Odoo Accounting."
msgstr "Hur ett detaljformulär för huvudvalutan ser ut i Odoo Accounting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:127
msgid ""
"All the fields are the same as a typical currency detail form, but there "
"will **not** be a :guilabel:`Rates` tab because all other currency rates are "
"based off the main currency of the company."
msgstr ""
"Alla fält är desamma som i ett vanligt formulär för valutadetaljer, men det "
"kommer **inte** att finnas en :guilabel:`Rates`-flik eftersom alla andra "
"valutakurser baseras på företagets huvudvaluta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:132
msgid "Create new currency"
msgstr "Skapa ny valuta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:134
msgid ""
"If a desired currency isn't on the :guilabel:`Currencies` page, click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button to open a blank currency template form."
msgstr ""
"Om önskad valuta inte finns på sidan :guilabel:`Valutor`, klicka på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Ny` för att öppna ett tomt formulär för valutamall."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:138
msgid ""
"The same :guilabel:`New` button is located in the upper-right corner of any "
"currency detail form."
msgstr ""
"Samma :guilabel:`New`-knapp finns i det övre högra hörnet på alla formulär "
"för valutadetaljer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:140
msgid "How a blank currency detail form looks in Odoo Accounting."
msgstr "Hur ett tomt formulär för valutadetaljer ser ut i Odoo Accounting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:144
msgid ""
"On the blank currency detail form, proceed to enter the desired currency "
"code in the :guilabel:`Currency` field. Beneath that, enter the name for the "
"currency in the :guilabel:`Name` field."
msgstr ""
"På det tomma formuläret för valutadetaljer fortsätter du med att ange önskad "
"valutakod i fältet :guilabel:`Currency`. Under detta anger du namnet på "
"valutan i fältet :guilabel:`Name`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:148
msgid ""
"Then, toggle the currency's availability with the :guilabel:`Active` toggle "
"switch."
msgstr ""
"Växla sedan valutans tillgänglighet med :guilabel:`Active`-vippknappen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:150
msgid ""
"On the right of the currency detail form, enter the "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Currency Unit` (e.g. `Dollars`) and "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Currency Subunit` (e.g. `Cents`)."
msgstr ""
"Till höger om formuläret för valutauppgifter anger du "
"lämplig :guilabel:`Valutaenhet` (t.ex. `Dollar`) och "
"lämplig :guilabel:`Valutaunderenhet` (t.ex. `Cents`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:153
msgid ""
"Next, under the :guilabel:`Rates` tab, add a new rate by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Then, proceed to confirm and adjust "
"the :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`Company`, :guilabel:`Unit per...`, "
"and :guilabel:`...per Unit` fields to ensure all the auto-populated "
"information is accurate."
msgstr ""
"Under fliken :guilabel:`Rates` lägger du sedan till en ny taxa genom att "
"klicka på :guilabel:`Add a line`. Fortsätt sedan med att bekräfta och "
"justera fälten :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`Company`, :guilabel:`Unit "
"per...` och :guilabel:`...per Unit` för att säkerställa att all information "
"som fylls i automatiskt är korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:165
msgid "Currency-specific pricelists"
msgstr "Valutaspecifika prislistor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:167
msgid ""
"It is recommended that *at least* one pricelist is created per active "
"currency in the database. To create (or assign) a pricelist to a specific "
"currency, start by navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> "
"Pricelists`."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att *minst* en prislista skapas per aktiv valuta i "
"databasen. För att skapa (eller tilldela) en prislista till en specifik "
"valuta, börja med att navigera till :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --"
"> Pricelists`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:171
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Pricelists` page, either select an existing pricelist to "
"edit, or click :guilabel:`New` to create a new pricelist."
msgstr ""
"På sidan :guilabel:`Pricelists` kan du antingen välja en befintlig prislista "
"att redigera, eller klicka på :guilabel:`New` för att skapa en ny prislista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:174
msgid ""
"On the pricelist detail form, for either a new or existing pricelist, adjust "
"the :guilabel:`Currency` field as desired."
msgstr ""
"På prislistans detaljformulär, för antingen en ny eller befintlig prislista, "
"justera :guilabel:`Currency` fältet efter önskemål."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:178
msgid ":doc:`./pricing` to learn more about pricelist configuration."
msgstr ":doc:`./pricing` för att lära dig mer om konfigurering av prislistor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:181
msgid "Auto-conversion from public price"
msgstr "Automatisk konvertering från offentligt pris"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:183
msgid ""
"It should be noted that the public price seen on products is directly "
"related to the main currency the company has set, which is configured by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings "
"--> Currencies section --> Main Currency --> Currency drop-down menu`."
msgstr ""
"Det bör noteras att det offentliga pris som visas på produkter är direkt "
"relaterat till den huvudvaluta som företaget har angett, vilket konfigureras "
"genom att navigera till :menuselection:`Räkenskapsapp --> Konfiguration --> "
"Inställningar --> Valutaavsnitt --> Huvudvaluta --> Rullgardinsmeny för "
"valuta`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:187
msgid ""
"The sales price automatically updates if the pricelist is changed to a "
"different pricelist that has a different currency than the company's main "
"currency. The change in price is directly related to the updated conversion "
"rate for that currency."
msgstr ""
"Försäljningspriset uppdateras automatiskt om prislistan ändras till en annan "
"prislista som har en annan valuta än företagets huvudvaluta. Prisändringen "
"är direkt relaterad till den uppdaterade omräkningskursen för den aktuella "
"valutan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:192
msgid "Set product prices"
msgstr "Ange produktpriser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:194
msgid ""
"In order to have product prices set in place to avoid any changes in "
"currency rates, start by navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products`."
msgstr ""
"För att kunna ställa in produktpriser för att undvika eventuella "
"förändringar i valutakurser, börja med att navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:197
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Products` page, select the desired product to modify. "
"Or, create a new product by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""
"Från sidan :guilabel:`Produkter`, välj önskad produkt att ändra. Du kan "
"också skapa en ny produkt genom att klicka på knappen :guilabel:`New`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:200
msgid ""
"Then, on the product detail form, click the :guilabel:`Extra Prices` smart "
"button, located in the upper-left corner. Doing so reveals a "
"separate :guilabel:`Price Rules` page, specific to that particular product."
msgstr ""
"Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Extrapriser` smart-knappen i det övre vänstra "
"hörnet på produktdetaljformuläret. Då visas en "
"separat :guilabel:`Prisregler`-sida som är specifik för just den produkten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:204
msgid ""
"How to set product prices based on foreign currency pricelists in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Hur man ställer in produktpriser baserat på prislistor i utländsk valuta i "
"Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:208
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New`, and select the desired pricelist from the drop-down "
"menu in the :guilabel:`Pricelist` column."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`New` och välj önskad prislista från rullgardinsmenyn i "
"kolumnen :guilabel:`Pricelist`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:211
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Applied On` field is auto-populated with the product, so "
"proceed to enter in the desired figures in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"and :guilabel:`Price` fields."
msgstr ""
"Fältet :guilabel:`Applied On` fylls i automatiskt med produkten, så fortsätt "
"med att ange önskade siffror i fälten :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"och :guilabel:`Price`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:215
msgid ""
"The figure in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` field means "
"the :guilabel:`Price` being set will **only** trigger if at least that "
"amount of product is purchased."
msgstr ""
"Siffran i fältet :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` innebär att det :guilabel:`Price` "
"som anges **bara** kommer att utlösas om minst den mängden produkt köps."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:218
msgid ""
"If necessary, configure a :guilabel:`Start Date` and :guilabel:`End Date` "
"for the set prices. Leaving those columns blank ensures the set price will "
"remain valid, regardless of the date of sale."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera vid behov :guilabel:`Startdatum` och :guilabel:`Slutdatum` för "
"de fasta priserna. Om du lämnar dessa kolumner tomma kommer det fasta priset "
"att förbli giltigt, oavsett försäljningsdatum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:221
msgid ""
"If working in a multi-company environment, designate to which company this "
"price rule should be applied in the :guilabel:`Company` field. Leaving that "
"field blank ensures the price rule applies to all companies in the database."
msgstr ""
"Om du arbetar i en miljö med flera företag, ange vilket företag denna "
"prisregel ska tillämpas på i :guilabel:`Company`-fältet. Om fältet lämnas "
"tomt gäller prisregeln för alla företag i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:225
msgid ""
"With those configurations complete, regardless of any changes/updates in "
"conversion, whenever those designated pricelists are applied to a customer "
"trying to purchase this specific product, these pre-determined set prices "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"När dessa konfigurationer är klara, oavsett eventuella ändringar/"
"uppdateringar i konverteringen, när de angivna prislistorna tillämpas på en "
"kund som försöker köpa denna specifika produkt, visas dessa förutbestämda "
"fasta priser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:230
msgid ":doc:`./pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`./pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Discounts* feature allows users to decrease or increase the price on "
"item lines in a sales quotation or order. This is calculated as a percentage "
"of the products' sales price."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen *Rabatter* gör det möjligt för användare att minska eller öka "
"priset på objektrader i en försäljningsoffert eller order. Detta beräknas "
"som en procentandel av produkternas försäljningspris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:8
msgid ""
"To access discounts in the **Sales** app, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, "
"tick the :guilabel:`Discounts` checkbox, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"För att få tillgång till rabatter i appen **Försäljning**, navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`. I "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Priser`, markera kryssrutan :guilabel:`Rabatter`, "
"klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:12
msgid ""
"After the setting has been activated, navigate to the desired quotation by "
"going to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` at the top of "
"the page. Once there, click on the desired quote from the list."
msgstr ""
"När inställningen har aktiverats navigerar du till önskad offert genom att "
"gå till :menyselection:` `Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` högst upp på "
"sidan. Väl där klickar du på önskad offert i listan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:17
msgid "Discounts on product lines"
msgstr "Rabatter på produktserier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:19
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab of the quotation form, a new column "
"heading appears labeled :guilabel:`Disc.%`. This column is used to set "
"discounts on individual line items. Enter the desired discount for each "
"product line and the new price is automatically calculated in "
"the :guilabel:`Total` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Orderrader` i offertformuläret visas en ny kolumnrubrik "
"med etiketten :guilabel:`Rabatt %`. Denna kolumn används för att ställa in "
"rabatter på enskilda radobjekt. Ange önskad rabatt för varje produktserie "
"och det nya priset beräknas automatiskt i :guilabel:`Totala` längst ner på "
"sidan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:25
msgid ""
"A discount can also be added directly to a sales order in the same way. "
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Orders`, click the "
"desired sales order, and add the discount to :guilabel:`Disc.%` field as "
"described above."
msgstr ""
"En rabatt kan också läggas till direkt i en försäljningsorder på samma sätt. "
"Navigera till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Beställningar --> "
"Beställningar`, klicka på önskad försäljningsorder och lägg till rabatten i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Rabatt %` enligt beskrivningen ovan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:29
msgid "The Dis.% heading will now appear in Order Lines."
msgstr "Rubriken Dis.% kommer nu att visas i orderraderna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:33
msgid ""
"Positive values for :guilabel:`Disc.%` will apply a *discount*, while "
"negative values can be used to *increase* the price."
msgstr ""
"Positiva värden för :guilabel:`Disc.%` ger en *rabatt*, medan negativa "
"värden kan användas för att *höja* priset."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:37
msgid ""
"Positive values, or price decreases, will be visible to the customer, while "
"negative values, or price increases, will *not* be visible to the customer. "
"Instead of a discount column, the negative discount will change the "
"product's unit price."
msgstr ""
"Positiva värden, eller prisminskningar, kommer att vara synliga för kunden, "
"medan negativa värden, eller prisökningar, *inte* kommer att vara synliga "
"för kunden. Istället för en rabattkolumn kommer den negativa rabatten att "
"ändra produktens enhetspris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:44
msgid "Discount button"
msgstr "Rabattknapp"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:46
msgid ""
"With the *Discounts* settings enabled, a :guilabel:`Discount` button appears "
"at the bottom of sales orders."
msgstr ""
"Med inställningen *Rabatter* aktiverad visas en :guilabel:`Rabatt`-knapp "
"längst ner i försäljningsorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:49
msgid ""
"The discount button located at the bottom of a sales order form in the Odoo "
"Sales app."
msgstr ""
"Rabattknappen som finns längst ner på ett försäljningsorderformulär i Odoo "
"Sales-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:52
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Discount` button on a sales order opens a pop-up "
"window, where the :guilabel:`Discount` percentage, and options are "
"configured:"
msgstr ""
"Att klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Rabatt` på en försäljningsorder öppnar ett "
"popup-fönster, där rabattprocenten och alternativen konfigureras i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Rabatt`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On All Order Lines`: Add the specified discount percentage "
"(configured in the :guilabel:`Discount` field of the pop-up window) on all "
"existing order lines of the sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`På alla orderrader`: Lägg till den angivna rabattprocenten "
"(konfigurerad i fältet :guilabel:`Rabatt` i popup-fönstret) på alla "
"befintliga orderrader i försäljningsordern."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Global Discount`: Add a discount product line to the order, which "
"has the cumulative value equivalent to the specified discount percentage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Global rabatt`: Lägg till en rabattproduktrad till ordern, som "
"har det ackumulerade värdet motsvarande den angivna rabattprocenten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:61
msgid ""
"A global discount of 10% is added in the last line of a sales order with a "
"subtotal of $4,200 by adding a discount line with a -$420 value (which is "
"10% of $4,200)."
msgstr ""
"En global rabatt på 10 % läggs till på den sista raden i en "
"försäljningsorder med en delsumma på 4 200 $ genom att lägga till en "
"rabattrad med värdet -420 $ (vilket är 10 % av 4 200 $)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:64
msgid ""
"The sales order with the applied global discount option in the Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Försäljningsordern med det tillämpade alternativet för global rabatt i Odoo "
"Sales-programmet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:68
msgid ""
"Any product added (or removed) *after* the global discount line is added "
"does **not** affect the discount value on the discount line. To include new "
"products or amend current products in the global discount, delete the "
"current global discount line and repeat the steps."
msgstr ""
"Alla produkter som läggs till (eller tas bort) *efter* att den globala "
"rabattraden har lagts till påverkar **inte** rabattvärdet på rabattraden. "
"För att inkludera nya produkter eller ändra nuvarande produkter i den "
"globala rabatten, radera den nuvarande globala rabattraden och upprepa "
"stegen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: Add a monetary amount to the :guilabel:`Discount` "
"field. Once applied, this amount is added to the order as a product line, "
"with the monetary value subtracted from the order total."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fast belopp`: Lägg till ett valutabelopp i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Rabatt`. När det har tillämpats läggs detta belopp till "
"ordern som en produktrad, med det valutavärde som dras av från ordertotalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:77
msgid ""
"A fixed discount of $20 appears as a product line, with a "
"negative :guilabel:`Unit Price`."
msgstr ""
"En fast rabatt på 20 $ visas som en produktserie med ett "
"negativt :guilabel:`Pris per enhet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:79
msgid ""
"The sales order with the applied fixed discount option in the Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Försäljningsordern med det tillämpade fasta rabattalternativet i Odoo-"
"försäljningsapplikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:83
msgid ""
"It is more beneficial to add a :guilabel:`Fixed Amount` discount after "
"**all** desired products have been added to a sales order. If there are "
"changes made to the sales order *after* the discount is added, adjust the "
"value on the :guilabel:`Discount` line, or remove the line and add the "
"discount again, as needed."
msgstr ""
"Det är mer fördelaktigt att lägga till en :guilabel:`Fast belopp`-rabatt "
"efter att **alla** önskade produkter har lagts till i en försäljningsorder. "
"Om det görs ändringar i försäljningsordern *efter* att rabatten har lagts "
"till, justera värdet på :guilabel:`Rabatt`-raden eller ta bort raden och "
"lägg till rabatten igen efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *pricelist* is a method of dynamic pricing that applies a list of prices "
"(or price rules) that overrides the sales price on a product's form. This "
"adjustment can be set to apply to all products sold or tailored to only "
"apply to specific customers, customer groups, sales orders, time periods, "
"etc., and is useful for creating pricing strategies and optimizing sales "
"margins."
msgstr ""
"En *prislista* är en metod för dynamisk prissättning som tillämpar en lista "
"med priser (eller prisregler) som åsidosätter försäljningspriset på en "
"produkts produktformulär. Denna justering kan ställas in att gälla för alla "
"sålda produkter eller skräddarsys för att endast gälla specifika kunder, "
"kundgrupper, försäljningsorder, tidsperioder osv., och är användbar för att "
"skapa prisstrategier och optimera försäljningsmarginaler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Odoo **Sales** has a useful pricelist feature that can be tailored to fit "
"any unique pricing strategy. Pricelists suggest certain prices, but they can "
"always be overridden on the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **Försäljning** har en användbar prislista-funktion som kan anpassas "
"för att passa vilken unik prisstrategi som helst. Prislistor föreslår vissa "
"priser, men de kan alltid åsidosättas på försäljningsordern."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:14
msgid ":doc:`currencies`"
msgstr ":doc:`currencies`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`../../../../websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../../websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:126
msgid ":doc:`../../../subscriptions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../prenumerationer`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:23
msgid ""
"To enable pricelists in the Odoo **Sales** app, first navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Pricing* section, enable the checkbox next to the :guilabel:`Pricelists` "
"feature, and click :guilabel:`Save` to save all changes."
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera prislistor i Odoo-appen **Försäljning**, navigera först "
"till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`. I "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Priser`, markera kryssrutan bredvid funktionen "
":guilabel:`Prislistor` och klicka på :guilabel:`Spara` för att spara alla "
"ändringar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:27
msgid "How the pricelist feature setting looks in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Så här ser funktionsinställningen för prislista ut i Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:30
msgid ""
"Access the *Pricelists* page by either clicking the :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` link (beneath the :guilabel:`Pricelists` "
"feature on the *Settings* page), or navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Products --> Pricelists`."
msgstr ""
"Öppna sidan *Prislistor* genom att antingen klicka på länken :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Prislistor` (under funktionen :guilabel:`Prislistor` på "
"sidan *Inställningar*) eller navigera till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> "
"Produkter --> Prislistor`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:34
msgid ""
"Either option reveals the *Pricelists* page, in which pricelists can be "
"created and modified at any time."
msgstr ""
"Båda alternativen visar sidan *Prislistor*, där prislistor kan skapas och "
"ändras när som helst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:38
msgid ""
"If there is no specific pricelist configured on a sales quotation, "
"the :guilabel:`Default` pricelist is applied. The :guilabel:`Default` "
"pricelist is the first pricelist found in :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Pricelists` without an assigned :guilabel:`Country Group`. Odoo "
"reads the :guilabel:`Pricelist Name` column from top to bottom to determine "
"the :guilabel:`Default` pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Om ingen specifik prislista har konfigurerats på en offert tillämpas "
"prislistan :guilabel:`Standard`. Prislistan :guilabel:`Standard` är den "
"första prislistan som hittas i :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Produkter --> "
"Prislistor` utan en tilldelad :guilabel:`Landsgrupp`. Odoo läser kolumnen "
":guilabel:`Prislistenamn` uppifrån och ned för att fastställa prislistan "
":guilabel:`Standard`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:45
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Selectable` column is only applicable to Odoo **eCommerce**. "
"This option allows website visitors to choose a pricelist when shopping in "
"the **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
"Kolumnen :guilabel:`Valbar` gäller endast Odoo **E-handel**. Detta "
"alternativ låter webbplatsbesökare välja en prislista när de handlar på "
"webbplatsen för **E-handel**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:48
msgid "Example of the pricelists page in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Exempel på sidan för prislistor i Odoo Försäljning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:54
msgid "Creating and editing pricelists"
msgstr "Skapa och redigera prislistor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:56
msgid ""
"From the *Pricelists* page, either select the pricelist to edit or "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a new pricelist, which reveals a blank "
"pricelist form that can be configured to suit the business's needs."
msgstr ""
"På sidan *Prislistor* väljer du antingen den prislista som ska redigeras "
"eller klickar på :guilabel:`Ny` för att skapa en ny prislista, vilket visar "
"ett tomt prislisteformulär som kan konfigureras för att passa verksamhetens "
"behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:60
msgid ""
"When creating a new pricelist, add the name for the pricelist by clicking in "
"the blank field at the top of the form. Next, select the type "
"of :guilabel:`Currency` the pricelist uses by clicking in the field to "
"access the drop-down menu and selecting an option."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en ny prislista lägger du till prislistans namn genom att "
"klicka i det tomma fältet högst upp i formuläret. Välj sedan vilken "
":guilabel:`Valuta` som prislistan använder genom att klicka i fältet för att "
"öppna rullgardinsmenyn och välja ett alternativ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:64
msgid ""
"If working in a multi-company environment, select which company this "
"pricelist should apply to in the :guilabel:`Company` field. If this field is "
"left blank, the pricelist is automatically applied to all companies in the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Om du arbetar i en fleraföretagsmiljö, välj vilket företag denna prislista "
"ska gälla för i fältet :guilabel:`Företag`. Om detta fält lämnas tomt "
"tillämpas prislistan automatiskt på alla företag i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:68
msgid ""
"If working in a multinational company, select the countries where this "
"pricelist applies under the :guilabel:`Country Groups` field."
msgstr ""
"Om du arbetar i ett multinationellt företag väljer du de länder där denna "
"prislista gäller i fältet :guilabel:`Landsgrupper`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:71
msgid "How the pricelist detail form looks in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Hur prislistans detaljformulär ser ut i Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:77
msgid "Adding price rules"
msgstr "Lägga till prisregler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the *Rules* tab, each line creates specific pricing rules. When the "
"pricelist is used on a sales order, Odoo applies those rules to calculate "
"the prices. This can be used to create complex pricing structures, such as "
"progressive discounts when greater quantities of a product are purchased."
msgstr ""
"Under fliken *Regler* skapar varje rad specifika prisregler. När prislistan "
"används på en försäljningsorder tillämpar Odoo dessa regler för att beräkna "
"priserna. Detta kan användas för att skapa komplexa prissättningsstrukturer, "
"såsom progressiva rabatter när större kvantiteter av en produkt köps."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:83
msgid ""
"To create a new price rule, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, which opens a "
"*Create Pricelist Rules* pop-up form."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en ny prisregel klickar du på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad`, "
"vilket öppnar popup-formuläret *Skapa prislisteregler*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Apply To` field, select whether the price rule applies to "
"a specific :guilabel:`Product` or a product :guilabel:`Category`. Depending "
"on the selection, the next field is either :guilabel:`Product` "
"or :guilabel:`Category`. Specify the product or category the pricelist "
"applies to, or leave the field blank to apply to all products or categories."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Tillämpa på` väljer du om prisregeln gäller för en "
"specifik :guilabel:`Produkt` eller en produkt-:guilabel:`Kategori`. Beroende "
"på valet är nästa fält antingen :guilabel:`Produkt` eller "
":guilabel:`Kategori`. Ange den produkt eller kategori som prislistan gäller "
"för, eller lämna fältet tomt för att tillämpa på alla produkter eller "
"kategorier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:92
msgid ""
"If a product doesn't have an assigned category, then it is not included in "
"the :guilabel:`All categories` option."
msgstr ""
"Om en produkt inte har en tilldelad kategori ingår den inte i alternativet "
":guilabel:`Alla kategorier`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:95
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Price Type`, select how the prices are adjusted, either "
"applying a :ref:`Discount <sales/pricing/discount>`, using a "
"specific :ref:`Formula <sales/pricing/formula>`, or applying a :ref:`Fixed "
"Price <sales/pricing/fixed-price>`."
msgstr ""
"För :guilabel:`Pristyp` väljer du hur priserna justeras, antingen genom att "
"tillämpa en :ref:`Rabatt <sales/pricing/discount>`, använda en specifik "
":ref:`Formel <sales/pricing/formula>` eller tillämpa ett :ref:`Fast pris "
"<sales/pricing/fixed-price>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:100
msgid ""
"If a price rule is set for a specific product, and another one for its "
"product category, Odoo prioritizes the *product* rule and applies it."
msgstr ""
"Om en prisregel har angetts för en specifik produkt och en annan för dess "
"produktkategori prioriterar Odoo regeln för *produkten* och tillämpar den."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:103
msgid ""
"If the price rule is part of a subscription, in the :guilabel:`Recurring "
"Plan` field drop-down menu, select a recurrence period. The default "
"selections are :guilabel:`Monthly`, :guilabel:`6 Months`, "
"or :guilabel:`Weekly`. New recurrence periods can also be created from this "
"field by clicking :guilabel:`Search more` and clicking :guilabel:`Create "
"New`."
msgstr ""
"Om prisregeln är en del av en prenumeration väljer du en återkommande period "
"i rullgardinsmenyn i fältet :guilabel:`Återkommande plan`. Standardvalen är "
":guilabel:`Månadsvis`, :guilabel:`6 månader` eller :guilabel:`Veckovis`. Nya "
"återkommande perioder kan också skapas från detta fält genom att klicka på "
":guilabel:`Sök fler` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa ny`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:108
msgid ""
"If the discount is only applied when a specific number of a product is "
"ordered, enter the amount in the :guilabel:`Min Qty` field."
msgstr ""
"Om rabatten endast tillämpas när ett visst antal av en produkt beställs, "
"anger du antalet i fältet :guilabel:`Min kvantitet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:111
msgid ""
"If a product has the *Packagings* field configured on its product form, "
"users can create pricing for individual packing options. The packaging field "
"appears next to the :guilabel:`Min Qty` field, but is not labeled. Clicking "
"the field displays a drop-down menu of configured packaging options."
msgstr ""
"Om en produkt har fältet *Förpackningar* konfigurerat på sitt "
"produktformulär kan användare skapa prissättning för enskilda "
"förpackningsalternativ. Förpackningsfältet visas bredvid fältet "
":guilabel:`Min kvantitet`, men saknar etikett. Om du klickar på fältet visas "
"en rullgardinsmeny med konfigurerade förpackningsalternativ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:115
msgid ""
"The field defaults to the assigned :abbr:`UoM (Unit of Measure)` configured "
"on the selected product. The packaging field only displays when the price "
"rule is configured for *Products*."
msgstr ""
"Fältet har som standard den tilldelade :abbr:`ME (måttenhet)` som "
"konfigurerats på den valda produkten. Förpackningsfältet visas endast när "
"prisregeln är konfigurerad för *Produkter*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:118
msgid ""
"If the discount is only valid on specific dates, such as a limited-time "
"sale, enter the start and end dates in the :guilabel:`Validity Period` field "
"during which this pricelist can be applied to quotations."
msgstr ""
"Om rabatten endast är giltig under specifika datum, till exempel vid en "
"tidsbegränsad rea, anger du start- och slutdatum i fältet "
":guilabel:`Giltighetsperiod` då denna prislista kan tillämpas på offerter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:122
msgid ""
"Once all configurations are complete, either click :guilabel:`Save & Close` "
"to save the pricelist rule, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` to immediately "
"create another pricelist rule on a fresh form."
msgstr ""
"När alla konfigurationer är klara klickar du antingen på :guilabel:`Spara "
"och stäng` för att spara prislistregeln, eller på :guilabel:`Spara och ny` "
"för att omedelbart skapa en ny prislistregel i ett tomt formulär."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:131
msgid "Configuring price types"
msgstr "Konfigurera pristyper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:133
msgid ""
"The *Create Pricelist Rules* pop-up form offers three different price types "
"to offer discounts or price increases."
msgstr ""
"Popup-formuläret *Skapa prislistregler* erbjuder tre olika pristyper för att "
"ge rabatter eller prishöjningar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:136
msgid ""
":ref:`Discount <sales/pricing/discount>`: Applies a percentage discount to "
"all products or a product category."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Rabatt <sales/pricing/discount>`: Tillämpar en procentuell rabatt på "
"alla produkter eller en produktkategori."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:138
msgid ""
":ref:`Formula <sales/pricing/formula>`: Applies a customizable discount "
"using multiple values, for more control over the calculation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Formel <sales/pricing/formula>`: Tillämpar en anpassningsbar rabatt "
"med flera värden, vilket ger mer kontroll över beräkningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:140
msgid ""
":ref:`Fixed Price <sales/pricing/fixed-price>`: Sets a flat sales price for "
"all products or a product category."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Fast pris <sales/pricing/fixed-price>`: Anger ett fast "
"försäljningspris för alla produkter eller en produktkategori."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:146
msgid "Configuring a discount"
msgstr "Konfigurera en rabatt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:148
msgid ""
"To configure a discount using a percentage as the computation, "
"select :guilabel:`Discount` for :guilabel:`Price Type` and enter the "
"percentage to be discounted. A mark-up can be configured by using a negative "
"value in this field."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera en rabatt med en procentsats som beräkning väljer du "
":guilabel:`Rabatt` för :guilabel:`Pristyp` och anger den procent som ska "
"dras av. Ett påslag kan konfigureras genom att ange ett negativt värde i "
"fältet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:152
msgid ""
"Next, select the base price Odoo uses to calculate the discount percentage. "
"The default is :guilabel:`sales price`, which refers to the *Sales price* "
"field on the product form. Other pricelists can be selected for the base "
"price from the drop-down menu. New pricelists can also be created from this "
"menu by clicking :guilabel:`Search more` and clicking :guilabel:`Create New`."
msgstr ""
"Välj sedan det baspris som Odoo använder för att beräkna rabattprocenten. "
"Standardvärdet är :guilabel:`försäljningspris`, vilket hänvisar till fältet "
"*Försäljningspris* på produktformuläret. Andra prislistor kan väljas som "
"baspris från rullgardinsmenyn. Nya prislistor kan också skapas från denna "
"meny genom att klicka på :guilabel:`Sök mer` och sedan på :guilabel:`Skapa "
"ny`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:157
msgid "A pricelist rule using Price Type as Discount to create a discount."
msgstr ""
"En prislistregel som använder Pristyp som Rabatt för att skapa en rabatt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:161
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is applied to a sales quotation with the :guilabel:`Price "
"Type` set as :guilabel:`Discount`, the discount is visible to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Om en prislista tillämpas på en säljeffert med :guilabel:`Pristyp` inställd "
"på :guilabel:`Rabatt`, är rabatten synlig för kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:167
msgid "Configuring a formula"
msgstr "Konfigurera en formel"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:170
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is applied to a sales quotation with the "
"discount :guilabel:`Price Type` set as :guilabel:`Formula`, the discount "
"will *not* be visible to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Om en prislista tillämpas på en försäljningsoffert med "
"rabatt :guilabel:`Pristyp` inställd som :guilabel:`Formel`, kommer rabatten "
"*inte* att vara synlig för kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:173
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Formula` option calculates pricelist rules using these "
"settings:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativet :guilabel:`Formel` beräknar prislistregler med följande "
"inställningar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:175
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based price`: Choose the base value for the calculation "
"— :guilabel:`Sales price`, :guilabel:`Cost` (both pulled from the product "
"form), or :guilabel:`Other Pricelist` (uses another pricelist as the base)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Baspris`: Välj basvärde för beräkningen – "
":guilabel:`Försäljningspris`, :guilabel:`Kostnad` (båda hämtas från "
"produktformuläret) eller :guilabel:`Annan prislista` (använder en annan "
"prislista som bas)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Discount`: The discount percentage to apply. Enter a negative "
"number to increase the price instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rabatt`: Den rabattprocent som ska tillämpas. Ange ett negativt "
"tal för att istället höja priset."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:180
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Round off to`: Rounds the price to the nearest multiple of this "
"value. Applied *after* the discount but *before* the :guilabel:`Extra Fee`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avrunda till`: Avrundar priset till närmaste multipel av detta "
"värde. Tillämpas *efter* rabatten men *före* :guilabel:`Extra avgift`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Fee`: Fixed amount added or subtracted "
"after :guilabel:`Discount` and :guilabel:`Round off to` are applied."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Extra avgift`: Fast belopp som läggs till eller dras ifrån efter "
"att :guilabel:`Rabatt` och :guilabel:`Avrunda till` har tillämpats."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:186
msgid ""
"To have prices that end in 9.99, set the :guilabel:`Round off to` value to "
"`10` and the :guilabel:`Extra Fee` to `-0.01`."
msgstr ""
"För att få priser som slutar på 9,99 anger du värdet för :guilabel:`Avrunda "
"till` till `10` och :guilabel:`Extra avgift` till `-0.01`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:192
msgid "Configuring a fixed price"
msgstr "Konfigurera ett fast pris"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:194
msgid ""
"To configure a :guilabel:`Fixed Price`, enter the new value that overrides "
"the configured *Sales Price* on a product form. The :guilabel:`Fixed Price` "
"value is applied per unit. When applied on a quotation, the *Unit Price* for "
"each order line uses the :guilabel:`Fixed Price` value."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera ett :guilabel:`Fast pris` anger du det nya värdet som "
"åsidosätter det konfigurerade *försäljningspriset* på ett produktformulär. "
"Värdet för :guilabel:`Fast pris` tillämpas per enhet. När det tillämpas på "
"en offert använder *enhetspriset* för varje orderrad värdet för "
":guilabel:`Fast pris`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:199
msgid "Company settings"
msgstr "Företagets inställningar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:201
msgid ""
"When in :ref:`Developer Mode <developer-mode/activation>`, the *Create "
"Pricelist Rules* pop-up form displays a *Company Settings* section. The "
"section has the following configuration options:"
msgstr ""
"I :ref:`Utvecklarläge <developer-mode/activation>` visar popup-formuläret "
"*Skapa prislistregler* avsnittet *Företagsinställningar*. Avsnittet har "
"följande konfigurationsalternativ:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:204
msgid ":guilabel:`Currency`: Assign a currency for the individual price rule."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Valuta`: Tilldela en valuta för den enskilda prisregeln."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:205
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: Assign a company for the individual price rule."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Företag`: Tilldela ett företag för den enskilda prisregeln."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:207
msgid ""
"Once all configurations are complete, either click :guilabel:`Save & Close` "
"to save the advanced pricelist rule, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` to "
"immediately create another advanced pricelist rule on a fresh form."
msgstr ""
"När alla konfigurationer är klara klickar du antingen på :guilabel:`Spara & "
"Stäng` för att spara den avancerade prislistan, eller på :guilabel:`Spara & "
"Ny` för att omedelbart skapa en ny avancerad prislista på ett nytt formulär."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:212
msgid "Pricelist rule logic"
msgstr "Logik för prislistregler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:214
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically selects a pricelist for a quotation when none has been "
"manually assigned. It checks the pricelists in the order they appear on the "
"*Pricelist* page, from top to bottom, and applies the first one whose "
"conditions match the quotation's details."
msgstr ""
"Odoo väljer automatiskt en prislista för en offert när ingen har tilldelats "
"manuellt. Den kontrollerar prislistorna i den ordning de visas på sidan "
"*Prislista*, uppifrån och ned, och tillämpar den första vars villkor matchar "
"offertens uppgifter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:218
msgid ""
"When multiple pricelist rules apply to the same product on the same "
"pricelist, Odoo determines priority using this order:"
msgstr ""
"När flera prislistregler gäller för samma produkt på samma prislista "
"fastställer Odoo prioriteten enligt denna ordning:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:221
msgid ""
":ref:`Most specific to least specific <sales/pricing/most-to-least-"
"specific>`: More specific rules take priority over general ones."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mest specifik till minst specifik <sales/pricing/most-to-least-"
"specific>`: Mer specifika regler har företräde framför allmänna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:223
msgid ""
":ref:`Minimum quantity (largest first) <sales/pricing/minimum-quantity>`: "
"The higher quantity thresholds take priority over lower ones."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Minsta kvantitet (störst först) <sales/pricing/minimum-quantity>`: "
"Högre kvantitetströsklar har företräde framför lägre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:225
msgid ""
":ref:`Category order <sales/pricing/category-order>`: Manually configured "
"category hierarchy breaks remaining ties where the subcategory takes "
"priority over the parent category."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Kategoriordning <sales/pricing/category-order>`: Manuellt konfigurerad "
"kategorihierarki avgör vid lika utfall, där underkategorin har företräde "
"framför överordnad kategori."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:227
msgid ""
":ref:`Creation date (newest first) <sales/pricing/creation-date>`: The most "
"recently created rule takes priority if all else is equal."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Skapandedatum (nyast först) <sales/pricing/creation-date>`: Den senast "
"skapade regeln har företräde om allt annat är lika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:233
msgid "1. Most specific to least specific"
msgstr "1. Mest specifik till minst specifik"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:235
msgid ""
"A rule on a specific variant always takes priority over a broader rule, so a "
"special price for one variant overrides a general category discount."
msgstr ""
"En regel för en specifik variant har alltid företräde framför en bredare "
"regel, så ett specialpris för en variant åsidosätter en allmän "
"kategorirabatt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:238
msgid "Product variant: Applies to the selected variant of the product."
msgstr "Produktvariant: Gäller för den valda varianten av produkten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:239
msgid "Product: Applies to all variants of a product."
msgstr "Produkt: Gäller för alla varianter av en produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:240
msgid "Subcategory: Applies to all products within the subcategory."
msgstr "Underkategori: Gäller för alla produkter inom underkategorin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:241
msgid "Parent category: Applies to all products in the parent category."
msgstr ""
"Överordnad kategori: Gäller för alla produkter i den överordnade kategorin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:242
msgid "All products: Applies to all products within the database."
msgstr "Alla produkter: Gäller för alla produkter i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:243
msgid ""
"All categories: Applies to all products with an assigned category. This "
"doesn't include uncategorized products."
msgstr ""
"Alla kategorier: Gäller för alla produkter med en tilldelad kategori. Detta "
"inkluderar inte okategoriserade produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:249
msgid "2. Minimum quantity (largest first)"
msgstr "2. Minsta kvantitet (störst först)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:251
msgid ""
"If the product specificity is the same, then rules with a higher minimum "
"quantity take priority over rules with a lower (or no) minimum. This keeps "
"bulk-pricing rules (e.g., 10 units) from being overridden by a generic rule "
"that also matches."
msgstr ""
"Om produktspecificiteten är densamma prioriteras regler med en högre minsta "
"kvantitet framför regler med ett lägre (eller inget) minimivärde. Detta "
"förhindrar att regler för mängdrabatt (t.ex. 10 enheter) åsidosätts av en "
"generell regel som också matchar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:258
msgid "3. Category order"
msgstr "3. Kategoriordning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:260
msgid ""
"If rules have the same specificity and same minimum quantity, Odoo uses the "
"manually configured category hierarchy, meaning the sequence is set on the "
"categories themselves."
msgstr ""
"Om reglerna har samma specificitet och samma minsta kvantitet använder Odoo "
"den manuellt konfigurerade kategorihierarkin, vilket innebär att ordningen "
"bestäms på själva kategorierna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:266
msgid "4. Creation date (newest first)"
msgstr "4. Skapandedatum (nyast först)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:268
msgid ""
"If everything else is equal, the most recently created rule takes priority. "
"This allows newer rules to override older ones with identical conditions, "
"which is useful when rules are updated or replaced without deleting the old "
"one immediately."
msgstr ""
"Om allt annat är lika prioriteras den senast skapade regeln. Detta gör att "
"nyare regler kan åsidosätta äldre med identiska villkor, vilket är "
"användbart när regler uppdateras eller ersätts utan att den gamla tas bort "
"direkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:275
msgid "Customer-specific pricelists"
msgstr "Kundspecifika prislistor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:277
msgid ""
"When a customer is added to the database, the *Default* pricelist is "
"automatically applied to the *Pricelist* field on a contact form. Even if "
"the field is left blank during :ref:`contact creation <contacts/contact-"
"form>`, the *Default* pricelist is automatically assigned when that contact "
"form is opened again."
msgstr ""
"När en kund läggs till i databasen tillämpas prislistan *Standard* "
"automatiskt i fältet *Prislista* på ett kontaktformulär. Även om fältet "
"lämnas tomt vid :ref:`kontaktskapande <contacts/contact-form>`, tilldelas "
"prislistan *Standard* automatiskt när kontaktformuläret öppnas igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:282
msgid ""
"To set a specific pricelist for a customer, go to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Orders --> Customers` and select the customer from the *Customers* page, "
"or click the customer's name on a sales order."
msgstr ""
"För att ange en specifik prislista för en kund går du till "
":menuselection:`Försäljningsappen --> Order --> Kunder` och väljer kunden på "
"sidan *Kunder*, eller klickar på kundens namn på en försäljningsorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:286
msgid ""
"On the customer's contact form, click the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, "
"in the *Sales* section, select a pricelist using the :guilabel:`Pricelist` "
"field drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"På kundens kontaktformulär klickar du på fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & "
"inköp`, och i avsnittet *Försäljning* väljer du en prislista med hjälp av "
"rullgardinsmenyn i fältet :guilabel:`Prislista`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:289
msgid "The pricelist field in a customer detail form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Prislista fältet i en kund detalj formulär i Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:292
msgid ""
"When the customer is added to a quotation, the *Pricelist* field is auto-"
"populated based on the information from their contact form. Users can "
"manually change the Pricelist using the *Pricelist* field on the quotation."
msgstr ""
"När kunden läggs till i en offert fylls fältet *Prislista* i automatiskt "
"baserat på informationen från deras kontaktformulär. Användare kan manuellt "
"ändra prislistan med hjälp av fältet *Prislista* på offerten."

