"Synchronize (TikTok Shop to Odoo) all confirmed orders (:abbr:`FBS "
"(Fulfilled By Seller)`) with status :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT` "
"or :guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION`, including:"
msgstr ""
"Synkronisera (TikTok Shop till Odoo) alla bekräftade order (:abbr:`FBS "
"(Fulfilled By Seller)`) med status :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT` eller "
":guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION`, inklusive:"

